Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:58.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}13米。你应该看得到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}13 meters. You should see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，带她上去，越过船首栏杆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, take her up and over the bow rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:19.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和平2号，我们正越过船首。跟上我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mir 2, we're going over the bow. Stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，安静。我们开始拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, quiet. We're rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看她从黑暗中驶来，像一艘幽灵船……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seeing her coming out of the darkness like a ghost ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每次都让我动容。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Still gets me every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到这艘巨轮凄凉的残骸躺在这里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To see the sad ruin of the great ship sitting here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:09.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她凌晨2点30分沉落的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...where she landed at 2:30 in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1912年4月15日……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of April 15, 1912...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:14.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在漫长的坠落之后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...after her long fall...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从上面的世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...from the world above.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老板，你真是太能扯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are so full of shit, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:53.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第六次下潜。我们又来到泰坦尼克号的甲板上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dive 6. Here we are again on the deck of Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下潜两英里半，3821米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2% miles down. 3,821 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外部压力是每平方英寸3.5吨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pressure outside is 3% tons per square inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些窗户厚9英寸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These windows are 9 inches thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:09.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们要是破了，两微秒内就拜拜了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they go, it's sayonara in two microseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:12.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，别说这些废话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, enough of that bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像昨天那样，把她停在军官舱顶上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just put her down on the roof of the officers' quarters like yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和平2号，我们正降落在主楼梯上方。你们准备好下水了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mir 2, we're landing right over the Grand Staircase. You guys set to launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，布洛克。现在放邓金号。上吧，查理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Brock. Launching Dunkin now. Go, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，放缆绳。——放缆绳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-All right, tether out.   -Tether out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:53.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，布洛克，我们正沿着船体下降。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Brock, we're dropping down along the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:05:00.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。好，下降，进入头等舱登船门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, roger that. Okay, drop down and go into the first class gangway door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:02.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你们搜索D甲板……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you guys working the D deck...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接待区和餐厅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...reception area and the dining saloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放缆绳。好，现在左转。左，左。好，向左转。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tether out. Okay, now left. Left, left. Okay, coming left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史努比狗开始移动了。我们正往楼梯井下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Snoop Dog is on the move. We're headed down the stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:33.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，刘易斯，下到B甲板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay Lewis, drop down to B deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:36.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，A甲板。——给我点绳子，船长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay, A deck.   -Give me some rope, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}B甲板。进去。进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}B deck. Get in there. Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心门框。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch the door frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:20.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心，小心。——看到了，我稳住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Watch it, watch it.   -I see it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:27.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题吧？把她降下来。——没问题。放松点，老板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We good? Bring her down.   -We're good. Just chill, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，转向。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, make your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放缆，船长。——转向。小心墙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Cable out, Captain.   -Make your turn. Watch the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的布洛克，我们到钢琴这里了。收到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah Brock, we're at the piano. You copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:51.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，就在那里。就在那里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, right there. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，就是这里，就是这里。那是卧室门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, that's it, that's it. That's the bedroom door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到了。看到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see it. I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:15.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们进来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们进来了，宝贝。到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're in, baby. We're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是霍克利的床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's Hockley's bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个混蛋就睡在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's where the son of a bitch slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀。有人忘了关水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oops. Somebody left the water running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停。停一下。往右回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold it. Hold it just a second. Go back to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个衣柜门。靠近点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That wardrobe door. Get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你闻到什么了吗，老板？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You smelling something, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想看看下面有什么。——把机械手给我，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I want to see what's under it.   -Give me my hands, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:07:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢点。可能会散架。——好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take it easy. It might come apart.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，来，来。翻过来。翻过来。上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, go, go. Flip it over. Flip it over. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她翻过来。继续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn her over. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，来，来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:08.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，放下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦宝贝，宝贝。你看到了吗，老板？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, baby, baby. Are you seeing this, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发薪日到了，伙计们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's payday, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叮叮——！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cha-ching!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们成功了，博比。——我们把它带回来了，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We did it, Bobby.   -We brought it back, Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:48.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦耶！谁最棒？谁最棒，宝贝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah! Who's the best? Who's the best, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说出来。说啊。说啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say it. Say it. Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最棒，刘易斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are, Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:56.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}博比，我的雪茄。——在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bobby, my cigar.   -Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:06.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，打开它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, crack her open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:37.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有钻石。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗老板，杰拉尔多也遇到过同样的事，他的事业再也没恢复。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know boss, this same thing happened to Geraldo and his career never recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把摄像机关了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn the camera off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布洛克，合伙人们想知道进展如何。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brock, the partners would like to know how it's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:10:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，戴夫，巴里，嗨。听我说，它不在保险箱里。但是嘿，嘿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Dave, Barry, hi. Look, I it wasn't in the safe. But hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:05.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。还有很多地方可能找到。当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Don't worry about it. There's still plenty of places it could be. Hell, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:07.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}套房地板碎片里，母亲房间……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The floor debris in the suite, the mother's room...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}C甲板的事务长保险箱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the purser's safe on C deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉米·霍法的公文包。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jimmy Hoffa's briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:15.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有十几个地方。伙计们，听着，你们得相信我的直觉。我知道我们很接近了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A dozen other places. Guys, look, you're just going to have to trust my instincts. I Know we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只需要做一点排除法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've just got to go through a little process of elimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:21.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我看看。——啊，我们可能有发现了，伙计们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let me see that.   -Ah, we may have something here, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:31.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}项链的照片在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the photograph of the necklace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:32.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们马上回电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll call you right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真是见鬼了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be goddamned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:52.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}寻宝人布洛克·洛维特以找到西班牙黄金闻名……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Treasure hunter Brock Lovett is best known for finding Spanish gold...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。我等会儿就喂你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay. I'll feed you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:11:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他包下俄罗斯潜艇，前往最著名的沉船——泰坦尼克号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now he has chartered Russian subs to reach the most famous shipwreck of all, the Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他正在研究船凯尔迪什号上通过卫星与我们直播连线……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He ts with us live via satellite from the research ship Keldysh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在北大西洋。你好，布洛克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...In the North Atlantic. Hello, Brock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，特蕾西。当然，大家都熟悉泰坦尼克号的那些故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Tracy. Of course, everyone knows the familiar stories of Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，乐队到最后还在演奏的高贵精神等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, the nobility of the band playing fo the very end and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:18.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我感兴趣的是那些不为人知的故事。深锁在泰坦尼克号船体里的秘密。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But what I'm interested in are the untold stories. The secrets locked deep inside the hull of Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:23.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在这里用机器人技术，深入残骸……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we're out here using robot technology fo go further into the wreck...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比以往任何人都更深。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...than anybody has ever done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:28.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的探险正处在争议风暴的中心……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your expedition is at the center of a storm of controversy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于打捞权甚至道德。很多人说你是盗墓贼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...over Salvage rights and even ethics. Many are calling you a graverobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，从来没人把打捞这些文物……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, nobody ever called the recovery of the artifacts...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把声音调大，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn that up, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:41.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我派了受过博物馆培训的专家来这里，确保……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have museum-trained experts sent out here making sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些遗物得到妥善保存和编目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that these relics are preserved and catalogued properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我们今天刚找到的这幅画。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take a look at this drawing that we found just today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一张在水下待了84年的纸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A piece of paper that's been underwater for 84 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的团队能把它完好地保存下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And my team are able to preserve it intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难道它就该永远躺在海底无人得见……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should this have remained unseen at the bottom of the ocean for eternity...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而我们如今却能欣赏它？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...when we can see and enjoy it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈不信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be goddamned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布洛克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有你的卫星电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a satellite call for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鲍比，我们要下水了。看到这些潜水器入水了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bobby, we're launching. You see these submersibles going in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我，老兄。这电话你得接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me, buddy. You want to take this call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最好是有要紧事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得大声点。她年纪挺大了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, you gotta speak up. She's kind of old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.03,0:12:22.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是布洛克·洛维特。有什么能帮您的，这位女士……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Brock Lovett. How can I help you, Mrs...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:28.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔弗特。露丝·卡尔弗特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calvert. Rose Calvert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:29.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔弗特太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Calvert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想知道你们有没有找到……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just wondering if you had found...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:36.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……“海洋之心”，洛维特先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the "Heart of the Ocean" yet, Mr. Lovett.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:40.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了你得接这电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Told you you wanted to take the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:45.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你成功引起我的注意了，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, you have my attention, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能告诉我们照片里的女人是谁吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you tell us who the woman in the picture is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:51.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，当然。照片里的女人就是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes. The woman in the picture is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是个骗子！哪来的疯婆子想骗钱或出名。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a goddamn liar! Some nutcase seeking money or publicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天知道为什么。就像那个俄罗斯妞，安娜丝黛西娅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God only knows why. Like that Russian babe, Anesthesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们回来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're inbound!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝·德威特·布克特17岁时死在泰坦尼克号上，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose DeWitt Bukater died on the Titanic when she was 17, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:31.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没错。  -她要是活着，现在得一百多岁了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's right.   -If she had lived, she'd be over 100 by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:33.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下个月就101岁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}101 next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那她就是个很老的骗子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so she's a very old goddamn liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:39.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我已经查过这个女人的底细了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I've already done the background on this woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:43.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一直查到20年代，她那时当演员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...all the way back to the 20s, when she was working as an actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}演员。这就是第一条线索，福尔摩斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An actress. There's your first clue, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那时她叫露丝·道森。后来嫁了个叫卡尔弗特的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her name was Rose Dawson back then. Then she marries this guy named Calvert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:54.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们搬到锡达拉皮兹，她生了两个孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They move to Cedar Rapids and she punches out a couple of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在卡尔弗特死了，听说锡达拉皮兹也完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now Calvert's dead and, from what I hear, Cedar Rapids is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道这颗钻石的人应该都死了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And everybody who knows about the diamond is supposed to be dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:03.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……或者在这条船上，可她却知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...or on this boat, but she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她这行李可真不少，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doesn't exactly travel light, does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，帮他一把。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry up, give him a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:24.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔弗特太太，我是布洛克·洛维特。欢迎来到凯尔迪什号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Calvert, I'm Brock Lovett. Welcome to the Keldysh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:28.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，扶她进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, let's get her inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，卡尔弗特小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Miss Calvert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:32.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你好。  -欢迎来到凯尔迪什号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi.   -Welcome to the Keldysh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们的舱房还满意吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are your staterooms all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你见过我孙女莉兹了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you met my granddaughter, Lizzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她照顾我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She takes care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:56.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们几分钟前刚见过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We met just a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:57.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记得吗，奶奶？在甲板上？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember, Nana? Up on deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:14:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:01.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。这样很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There. That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:04.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我出门总得带着我的照片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have to have my pictures when I travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:05.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不要给你拿点什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I get you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么想要的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anything you'd like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:09.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想看看我的画。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would like to see my drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}路易十六戴过一颗绝世宝石，叫……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Louis XVI wore a fabulous stone that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……“王冠蓝钻”……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...called the Blue Diamond of the Crown...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它于1792年失踪……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...which disappeared in 1792...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……差不多同时，老路易脑袋以上都没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...about the same time old Louis lost everything from the neck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:42.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据推测，那颗王冠钻石也被切开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The theory goes that the crown diamond was chopped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重新切割成心形，从此被称为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Recut into a heart-like shape that became known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……“海洋之心”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the Heart of the Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如今它比“希望之钻”还值钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Today it would be worth more than the Hope diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那东西又沉又难看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a dreadful, heavy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只戴过那一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I only wore it this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:57.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得这是你吗，奶奶？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You actually think this is you, Nana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is me, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当年是不是很美？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wasn't I a dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是通过保险记录查到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tracked it down through insurance records.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:09.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一份在绝对保密条件下结案的旧索赔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An old claim that was settled under terms of absolute secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能告诉我索赔人是谁吗，露丝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you tell me who the claimant was, Rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜是姓霍克利的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should imagine someone named Hockley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}内森·霍克利，没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nathan Hockley, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}匹兹堡钢铁大亨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pittsburgh steel tycoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:23.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}索赔的是他儿子……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The claim was fora diamond necklace his son...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……卡莱顿买给未婚妻的钻石项链。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Caledon, bought his fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在他乘泰坦尼克号出海前一周。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A week before he sailed on Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且是在沉船后立刻提交的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it was filed right after the sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以钻石肯定随船沉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So the diamond had to have gone down with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到日期了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see the date?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1912年4月14日。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}April 14, 1912.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是说，如果你祖母真是她说的那个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which means if your grandmother is who she says she is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:48.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……泰坦尼克号沉没那天她正戴着这颗钻石。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...she was wearing the diamond the day the Titanic sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就成了我的新好朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that makes you my new best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些是我们从你舱房里打捞上来的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are some of the things we recovered from your stateroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:17:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是不可思议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:07.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和我上次见到时一模一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it looks the same as it did the last time I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倒影倒是变了些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The reflection has changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:35.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好重返泰坦尼克号了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you ready to go back to Titanic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她右舷撞上冰山，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She hits the berg on the starboard side, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就那么擦着过去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She kind of bumps along...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:45.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……像摩斯电码一样打出洞……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...punching holes like morse code...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——滴-滴-滴——沿着船身……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-- dit-dit-dit -- along the side...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:48.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…在水线以下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...below the water line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后前面的舱室开始进水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then the forward compartments start to flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:53.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随着水位上升…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, as the water level rises...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…水漫过防水舱壁…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...it spills over the watertight bulkheads...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…可惜这些舱壁最高只到E甲板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...which, unfortunately, don't go any higher than E deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是船头往下沉…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So now as the bow goes down...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…船尾就翘起来，起初很慢…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the stern rises up, slow at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:04.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…然后越来越快…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...then faster and faster...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…最后整个屁股都翘到半空中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Uuntil finally, she's got her whole ass sticking up in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可是个巨大的屁股。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's a big ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:12.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}足有两三万吨，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're talking 20, 30,000 tons. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船体可承受不了那种压力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the hull's not designed to deal with that pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:16.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船从中间裂开，一直裂到龙骨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She splits, right down to the keel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船尾…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the stern...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…又回落平正。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...falls back level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:23.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…船头下沉…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...as the bow sinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.39,0:18:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…把船尾拉成垂直…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...it pulls the stern vertical...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…最后断开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and then finally detaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:31.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船尾那截就像软木塞一样在水面漂了几分钟…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now the stern section just kind of bobs there like a cork for a couple of minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:35.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…进水，最后在凌晨2点20分左右沉没…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...floods, and finally goes under about 2:20 AM...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:37.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…距撞击两小时四十分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..2 hours and 40 minutes after the collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船头那截滑行下沉…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bow section planes away...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:43.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…落在半英里外…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...landing about a half a mile away...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…撞到海底时速度有二三十节。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...going 20, 30 knots when it hits the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺酷吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你这番精彩的分析，博丁先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for that fine forensic analysis, Mr. Bodine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:19:00.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，亲历的感受…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, the experience of it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…还是有点不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...somewhat different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.02,0:19:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意跟我们分享吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you share it with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我带她去休息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm taking her to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:03.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，奶奶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Nana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把录音机给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the tape recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我们说说吧，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell us, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:18.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经84年了——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been 84 years--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系，试着回忆一下…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay. Just try to remember anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…想起什么都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底想不想听，洛维特先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to hear this or not, Mr. Lovett?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经84年了…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been 84 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:38.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…我还能闻到新漆的味道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and I can still smell the fresh paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瓷器从没被用过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The china had never been used.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}床单从没被人睡过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The sheets had never been slept in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰坦尼克号被称为梦想之船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Titanic was called the ship of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:54.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它确实是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:29.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有三等舱乘客…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All third-class passengers...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…有前舱位的…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...With a forward berth...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…请走这边！排这队！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...this way please! This queue!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:36.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这船真大，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a big boat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸，是轮船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Daddy, it's a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:11.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不明白有什么好大惊小怪的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't see what all the fuss is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看起来不比毛里塔尼亚号大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't look any bigger than the Mauretania.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些事你可以满不在乎，露丝…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can be blasé about some things, Rose...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…但对泰坦尼克号不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but not about Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它比毛里塔尼亚号长一百多英尺…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's over 100 feet longer than Mauretania...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:21.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…而且豪华得多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and far more luxurious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你女儿可真难取悦，鲁丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your daughter is far too difficult to impress, Ruth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:28.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是那艘据说永不沉没的船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is the ship they say is unsinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它确实不会沉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is unsinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连上帝也弄不沉这艘船——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God Himself could not sink this ship--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行李得从主航站楼托运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to check your baggage through the main terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在那边，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's round that way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就拜托您了，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I put my faith in you good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:37.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请多照应我的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now kindly see my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的先生，乐意效劳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes sir. It's my pleasure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.11,0:22:40.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有任何需要尽管说…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I can do anything at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:43.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边车厢里的所有箱子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All the trunks from that car there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.90,0:22:45.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿有12个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}12 from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有保险箱，送到会客套房…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the safe, to the parlor suite...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…B-52、54、56号房。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...frooms B-52, 54, 56.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.25,0:22:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…我们得快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:22:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:03.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我的外套呢？  -我拿着呢，小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-My coat?   -I have it, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.38,0:23:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有三等舱乘客在此排队接受健康检查。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All third-class passengers queue here for health inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:19.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-欢迎登船，女士。  -欢迎来到泰坦尼克号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Welcome aboard, ma'am.   -Welcome to Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:22.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是梦想之船…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lt was the ship of dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…对其他人来说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.78,0:23:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我来说，那是一艘奴隶船…\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To me, itwas a Slave ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.62,0:23:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}…用锁链把我押回美国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...taking me back to America in chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}表面上，我具备一个教养良好的女孩应有的一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Outwardly, I was everything a well brought up girl should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:38.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}内心里，我在尖叫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Inside, I was screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:56.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，你疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack, you are pazzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.48,0:23:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我们所有的钱都押上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You bet everything we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:01.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一无所有，就没什么可失去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you got nothing, you got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.07,0:24:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯文？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，关键时刻到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人的人生就要改变了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone's life is about to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法布里齐奥？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fabrizio?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:42.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Niente.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.69,0:24:44.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥拉夫？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.69,0:24:46.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.19,0:24:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯文？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.20,0:24:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，两对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-oh. 2 pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，法布里齐奥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Fabrizio.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.29,0:24:59.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.50,0:25:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你要很久见不到你妈妈了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you're not gonna see your mom again for a...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.12,0:25:02.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……很长一段时间……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……因为我们要去美国了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Cause we're going to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.75,0:25:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}葫芦，伙计们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Full house, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.06,0:25:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.15,0:25:23.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要回家了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.52,0:25:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.28,0:25:29.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要去美国了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I go to America!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.90,0:25:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，兄弟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.57,0:25:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰坦尼克号是去美国的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Titanic go to America,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在5分钟后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.58,0:25:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。法布里，快走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit. Fabri. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.70,0:25:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，这儿，这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, here. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在可是高级待遇了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're riding in high style now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.75,0:25:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们俩可真是十足的绅士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're a couple of regular swells.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:46.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们简直就是他妈的皇亲国戚……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're practically goddamn royalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.38,0:25:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我的老弟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...fagazzo mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.59,0:25:49.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见没？这就是我的命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see? Is my destino.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.05,0:25:51.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我跟你说的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.22,0:25:52.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去美国就是要当百万富翁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I go to America to be millionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:25:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are pazzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:25:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许吧，但票在我手上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe, but I've got the tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.02,0:26:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点儿，我还以为你跑得很快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, I thought you were fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aspetta!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.19,0:26:05.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，等等！等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa. Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:08.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是乘客！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're passengers!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.11,0:26:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们做过检疫检查了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you been through the inspection queue?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.49,0:26:13.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.57,0:26:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正我们身上没虱子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, we don't have any lice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是美国人，我们俩都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're Americans. Both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上船吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.46,0:26:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是全世界最走运的混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're the luckiest sons of bitches in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.17,0:26:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.30,0:26:36.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.43,0:26:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认识什么人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.56,0:26:43.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然不认识。这又不是重点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course not. That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.31,0:26:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见！我会想你的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good-bye! I'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.98,0:26:46.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.56,0:26:48.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远不会忘记你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will never forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.53,0:27:38.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我来，亲爱的。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come with me, darling. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}G-60。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}G-60.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.37,0:27:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}G-60。G-60。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}G-60. G-60.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.37,0:27:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，女士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, ma''am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}G-60。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}G-60.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.04,0:27:51.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.21,0:27:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你好啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。很高兴认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.72,0:27:57.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克·道森。很高兴认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack Dawson. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.68,0:27:58.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.39,0:28:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁说上铺归你了，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who says you get top bunk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.35,0:28:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是您的私人散步甲板，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is your private promenade deck, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.60,0:28:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您还需要什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you be requiring anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:15.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这幅？  -不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This one?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.74,0:28:17.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那幅上面有很多脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It had a lot of faces on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.40,0:28:19.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这幅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.58,0:28:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都要挂出来吗，小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you like all of them out, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.74,0:28:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。这房间需要点色彩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. We need a little color in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放那儿。放进衣柜里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put in there. In the wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.92,0:28:35.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，又是那些涂鸦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, not those finger paintings again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.42,0:28:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些钱真是白花了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They certainly were a waste of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.09,0:28:38.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔对艺术的品味和我的区别……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The difference between Cal's taste in art...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.01,0:28:40.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就在于我有品味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and mine is that I have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们很迷人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.76,0:28:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像置身梦境一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like being inside a dream or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.43,0:28:46.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有真实感，却不合逻辑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's truth but no logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.02,0:28:49.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-画家叫什么？  -好像叫毕加索什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's the artist's name?   -Something Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.10,0:28:51.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毕加索什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.40,0:28:53.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他将来不会有什么成就的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He won't amount to a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.23,0:28:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会的，相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He won't, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.78,0:28:57.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把德加那幅放到卧室。  -至少它们很便宜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's put the Degas in the bedroom.   -At least they were cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.78,0:28:59.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放进衣柜里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put it in the wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.12,0:29:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在瑟堡，一位叫玛格丽特·布朗的女士上了船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At Cherbourg, a woman came aboard named Margaret Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.79,0:29:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都叫她莫莉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We all called her Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}历史会称她为“永不沉没的莫莉·布朗”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}History would call her the Unsinkable Molly Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.30,0:29:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可没打算等你一整天，小伙子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I wasn't about to wait all day for you, sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.55,0:29:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给，如果你觉得自己搞得定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, if you think you can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.30,0:29:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她丈夫在西部某处挖到了金矿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her husband had struck gold someplace out west.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.64,0:29:26.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是母亲所说的“暴发户”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she was what Mother called "new money."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.64,0:29:28.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了第二天下午……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the next afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.02,0:29:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我们正从爱尔兰海岸向西航行……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we were steaming west from the coast of Ireland...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.60,0:29:36.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……前方除了大海什么也没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with nothing out ahead of us but ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.32,0:29:44.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带她出海吧，默多克先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take her to sea, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.41,0:29:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让她舒展一下筋骨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's stretch her legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.33,0:29:51.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全速前进，穆迪先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All ahead full, Mr. Moody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.12,0:29:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.63,0:29:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全速前进。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All ahead full.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.46,0:30:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全速前进！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All ahead full!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.72,0:30:03.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，小伙子们，麻利点儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on lads, step lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.45,0:30:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！把炉火烧得旺旺的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right! Let's stoke her right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.78,0:30:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全速前进！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We go full ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.32,0:30:28.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加油，使劲干！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, put your backs into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.09,0:31:24.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}21节，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}21 knots, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.85,0:31:34.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，看，看，看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.10,0:31:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.78,0:31:44.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又有一个！看见他了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's another one! See him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看那个！看他跳！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at that one! Look at him jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.57,0:32:25.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经能看到自由女神像了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can see the Statue of Liberty already.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.15,0:32:27.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，还很小。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very small, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.16,0:32:33.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是世界之王！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the king of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是人类双手建造过的最大的可移动物体……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is the largest moving object ever made by the hand of man...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.29,0:33:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……有史以来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in all history.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.63,0:33:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有我们的总造船师，安德鲁斯先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And our master shipbuilder, Mr. Andrews here...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.84,0:33:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……从龙骨板开始设计了她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...designed her from the keel plates up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.97,0:33:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我或许把她拼装了起来，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I may have knocked her together, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.09,0:33:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这个主意是伊斯梅先生的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the idea was Mr. Ismay's.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.64,0:33:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他设想了一艘规模如此宏大的蒸汽船……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He envisioned a steamer so grand in scale...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而且如此奢华……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and so luxurious in...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……其设施……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...its appointments...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.35,0:33:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它的霸主地位永远无人能挑战。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that its supremacy would never be challenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:43.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.40,0:33:46.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—化为坚实的现实。  -—说得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Willed into solid reality.   -Hear, hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.86,0:33:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要三文鱼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll have the salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.40,0:33:54.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我不喜欢那样，罗丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I don't like that, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.41,0:33:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.58,0:34:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们俩都要羊肉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll both have the lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.17,0:34:06.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三分熟，薄荷酱少一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rare, with very little mint sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.42,0:34:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢羊肉吧，小甜心？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like lamb, right sweet pea?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.68,0:34:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔，你还要替她切肉吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gonna cut her meat for her too there, Cal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.43,0:34:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，泰坦尼克这个名字是谁想出来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, who thought of the name Titanic?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.10,0:34:21.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你吗，布鲁斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was it you, Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.27,0:34:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，确实是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.44,0:34:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想表达纯粹的巨大。而大意味着稳定……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to convey sheer size. And size means stability...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.11,0:34:31.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……奢华，最重要的是力量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...luxury, and above all, strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.95,0:34:34.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊斯梅先生，你听说过弗洛伊德博士吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know of Dr. Freud, Mr. Ismay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.70,0:34:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他关于男性对尺寸执迷的看法，也许你会特别感兴趣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His ideas about the male preoccupation with size might be of particular interest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.45,0:34:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:43.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.96,0:34:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实在抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.55,0:34:51.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她可是个烈性子，卡尔。希望你能驾驭得了她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a pistol, Cal. Hope you can handle her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.46,0:34:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来我以后得管管她读什么书了，对吧，布朗太太？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I may have to start minding what she reads from now on, won't I, Mrs. Brown?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.64,0:34:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗洛伊德？他是谁？是乘客吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freud? Who is he? Is he a passenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.69,0:35:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这船不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ship is nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.53,0:35:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。这是爱尔兰船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. It's an Irish ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.66,0:35:16.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是英国的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is English, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.78,0:35:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是在爱尔兰造的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it was built in Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.87,0:35:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一万五千个爱尔兰人造了这艘船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}15,000 Irishmen built this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.87,0:35:22.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坚如磐石。爱尔兰人的大手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Solid as a rock. Big Irish hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老一套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.33,0:35:27.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}头等舱的狗跑下来拉屎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First-class dogs come down here to take a shite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.13,0:35:30.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好让我们知道自己排在什么位置。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lets us know where we rank in the scheme of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.38,0:35:32.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像我们能忘似的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like we could forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.72,0:35:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是汤米·瑞恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Tommy Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.18,0:35:37.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—杰克·道森。  -—法布里奇奥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jack Dawson.   -Fabrizio.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你画画能挣钱吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you make any money with your drawings?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.90,0:35:53.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉，算了吧，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, forget it, boyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.65,0:35:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还不如指望屁眼里飞出天使，想接近……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd as like have angels fly out of your arse as get next to...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.07,0:35:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……她那样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the likes of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.93,0:36:24.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我仿佛看到了自己的一生，好像早已活过一遍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw my whole life as if I'd already lived it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.27,0:36:28.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没完没了的派对和舞会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An endless parade of parties and cotillions...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.10,0:36:31.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……游艇和马球赛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... yachts and polo matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.77,0:36:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总是同样那些狭隘的人，同样无脑的闲扯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Always the same narrow people, the same mindless chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.95,0:36:40.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得自己站在巨大的悬崖边……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I felt like I was standing at a great precipice...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.45,0:36:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……没人把我拉回来。没人在乎……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with no one to pull me back. No one who cared...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.95,0:36:48.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……甚至没人注意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...or even noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.69,0:38:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.74,0:38:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.07,0:38:44.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再靠近了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.82,0:38:46.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.91,0:38:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我。我把你拉回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me your hand. I'll pull you back over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.54,0:38:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！站在那里别动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.08,0:38:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是认真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.75,0:38:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会松手的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.43,0:39:06.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你不会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.43,0:39:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么叫我不会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean, no I won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.56,0:39:13.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别擅自断定我会做什么、不会做什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't presume to tell me what I will and will not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.35,0:39:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不了解我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:16.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要真想跳，早就跳了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you would have done it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.44,0:39:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在分散我的注意力。走开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're distracting me. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.94,0:39:21.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.28,0:39:22.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在已经牵扯进来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm involved now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.44,0:39:26.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是松手，我就得跟着跳下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You let go, and I'm going to have to jump in there after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.62,0:39:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—你会死的。  -—我水性很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You'll be killed.   -I'm a good swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光是摔下去就能要你的命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The fall alone will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.12,0:39:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定会疼。我没说不疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would hurt. I'm not saying it wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.96,0:39:40.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell you the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.59,0:39:43.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我更担心那水太冷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...['m a lot more concerned about that water being so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.30,0:39:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有多冷？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.97,0:39:55.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冰冷刺骨。大概就比冰点高几度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freezing. Maybe a couple degrees over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.65,0:40:00.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去过，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ever, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.98,0:40:02.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……去过威斯康星吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..ever been to Wisconsin?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.99,0:40:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.45,0:40:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那儿有些冬天是最冷的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, they have some of the coldest winters around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.16,0:40:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在那儿长大，奇珀瓦瀑布附近。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I grew up there, near Chippewa Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.16,0:40:16.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我记得小时候，我和我爸去冰钓……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember when I was a kid, me and my father, we went ice fishing...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.16,0:40:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在威索塔湖上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...out on Lake Wissota.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.58,0:40:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冰钓就是，你知道，就是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ice fishing is, you Know, where you--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.17,0:40:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道冰钓是什么！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know what ice fishing is!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.34,0:40:30.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来就是那种，你知道，养在室内的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just seem like, you know, kind of an indoor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.01,0:40:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.68,0:40:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……踩塌了薄冰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...fell through some thin ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.85,0:40:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.85,0:40:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那么冷的水，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...water that cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.31,0:40:43.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在那下面……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like right down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.98,0:40:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像一千把刀扎遍你全身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...it hits you like 1000 knives stabbing you all over your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.82,0:40:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没法呼吸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.20,0:40:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没法思考。除了疼痛什么都想不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't think. Least not about anything but the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.71,0:41:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我可不期待跟着你跳下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is why I'm not looking forward to jumping in there after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.04,0:41:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我说的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.88,0:41:07.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我别无选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...l don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.72,0:41:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有点希望你能翻回栏杆这边，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess I'm kind of hoping you'll come back over the rail and...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.64,0:41:16.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……让我脱身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and get me off the hook here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.89,0:41:18.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:21.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都这么说，可是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what everybody says but...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.23,0:41:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……恕我直言，小姐……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with all due respect, miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.98,0:41:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……挂在船尾的人可不是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I'm not the one hanging off the back of a ship here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.57,0:41:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.57,0:41:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.16,0:41:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不想这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.43,0:41:51.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫杰克·道森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Jack Dawson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:55.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗丝·德维特·布克特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose DeWitt Bukater.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.39,0:41:57.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这名字我得让你写下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll have to get you to write that one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.60,0:42:00.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.06,0:42:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓住你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.57,0:42:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.74,0:42:16.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救命，求求你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.37,0:42:17.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救命！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.41,0:42:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-求求你，救救我！  -听着。听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please, help me!   -Listen. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.58,0:42:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着。听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.29,0:42:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓住你了。我不会松手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got you. I won't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.25,0:42:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在爬上来。来吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now pull yourself up. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.30,0:42:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.55,0:42:31.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.13,0:42:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能行的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.14,0:42:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓住你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.15,0:42:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.49,0:42:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你退后，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You stand back and...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.99,0:42:55.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一步都不许动！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..don't move an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.74,0:42:58.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去叫纠察长来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fetch the Master at Arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.50,0:43:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直不可容忍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is completely unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.16,0:43:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你凭什么以为可以碰我的未婚妻？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What made you think that you could put your hands on my fiancée?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.67,0:43:08.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着我，你这混蛋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at me, you filth!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.17,0:43:10.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.34,0:43:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think you were doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.67,0:43:14.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔，住手。这是个意外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cal, stop. It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.84,0:43:16.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意外？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.84,0:43:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.18,0:43:20.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的很蠢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stupid, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.18,0:43:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我探出身子，然后滑倒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was leaning over and I slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.19,0:43:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我探得很出去，想看看那个，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was leaning far over to see the, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.02,0:43:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……呃，呃，那个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...uh, uh, the uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.19,0:43:35.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-螺旋桨？  -螺旋桨，然后我滑倒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Propellers?   -Propellers, and I slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.86,0:43:38.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来要掉下去了，可这位道森先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I would have gone overboard but Mr. Dawson here...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.87,0:43:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……救了我。他自己差点也掉下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...saved me. And almost went over himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.95,0:43:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想看……她想看螺旋桨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanted to see the... She wanted to see the propellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.37,0:43:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我说的，女人和机械格格不入。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I said, women and machinery do not mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.38,0:43:50.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是这样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was that the way of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.88,0:43:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。对，差不多就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah, that was pretty much it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.22,0:43:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那这小子就是个英雄了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, the boy's a hero then.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.38,0:43:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，孩子。干得漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good for you, son. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.89,0:44:00.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，皆大欢喜，我们回去喝白兰地吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it's all's well and back to our brandy, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.56,0:44:06.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你。你一定冻坏了。我们进屋去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at you. You must be freezing. Let's get you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.56,0:44:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许该给这小子一点赏钱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps a little something for the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.07,0:44:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.69,0:44:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莱弗乔先生，我看给二十块就够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Lovejoy, I think a 20 should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.90,0:44:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救了你心爱的女人就值这个价？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that the going rate for saving the woman you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.24,0:44:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗丝不高兴了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose is displeased.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.58,0:44:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么办呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.71,0:44:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.92,0:44:33.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你明晚可以来和我们共进晚餐……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps you could join us for dinner tomorrow evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.92,0:44:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……给我们讲讲……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to regale our group...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.76,0:44:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你的英雄事迹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with your heroic tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.26,0:44:42.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。算我一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure. Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.76,0:44:45.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。那就这么定了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. It's settled then.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.10,0:44:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这应该会很有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This should be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.78,0:44:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能给我根烟吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I bum a smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.29,0:45:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好把鞋带系上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll want to tie those.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.13,0:45:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有意思的是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.79,0:45:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这位小姐滑倒得那么突然……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the young lady slipped so suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.76,0:45:19.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你还有时间脱掉外套和鞋子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and you still had time to remove your jacket and your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.32,0:45:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你一直郁郁寡欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know you've been melancholy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想假装知道原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't pretend to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.99,0:45:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来想把这个留到……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I intended to save this...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.66,0:45:50.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……下周的订婚晚宴……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...until the engagement gala next week...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.67,0:45:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……可是，我想……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but, I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.34,0:45:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就今晚吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.13,0:45:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.26,0:46:02.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许能提醒你我对你的感情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps as a reminder of my feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.84,0:46:04.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是不是……  -钻石。是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-ls it a-- -Diamond. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.68,0:46:09.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准确说是56克拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}56 carats to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.85,0:46:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}路易十六戴过它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was worn by Louis XVI.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.02,0:46:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们称它为“海洋之心”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they called it Le Coeur de la Mer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.86,0:46:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-海洋之心。  -海洋之心。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The Heart of the Ocean.   -The Heart of the Ocean. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.20,0:46:27.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太震撼了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.33,0:46:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是给王室戴的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it's for royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.20,0:46:33.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就是王室，罗丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are royalty, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.38,0:46:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我什么都能给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, there's nothing I couldn't give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.55,0:46:42.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么都不会拒绝你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing I'd deny you...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.22,0:46:45.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……只要你不拒绝我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...If you would not deny me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.56,0:46:51.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向我敞开心扉吧，罗丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open your heart to me, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.41,0:47:11.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我十五岁起就一个人了，父母去世后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I've been on my own since I was 15, since my folks died.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.41,0:47:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在那儿没有兄弟姐妹，也没有近亲……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I had no brothers or sisters or close kin in that part of the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.88,0:47:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……所以我就离开了那儿，再也没回去过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...SO I lit on out of there and I haven't been back since.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.42,0:47:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以叫我随风滚的风滚草。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could just call me a tumbleweed blowing in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.09,0:47:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萝丝，我们在这甲板上走了快一英里了，还……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Rose, we've walked about a mile around this boat deck and...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.56,0:47:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……聊了天气多好，还有我怎么长大的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...chewed over how great the weather's been and how I grew up...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.77,0:47:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但我想你来找我说话，不是因为这个吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but I reckon that's not why you came to talk to me, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.44,0:47:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-道森先生，我—— -叫我杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mr. Dawson, I-- -Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.86,0:47:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.28,0:47:46.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想谢谢你做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to thank you for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.61,0:47:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不只是把我拉回来，还有你的守口如瓶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not just for pulling me back, but for your discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.62,0:47:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.45,0:47:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.54,0:47:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你一定在想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know what you must be thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.46,0:48:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜的富家小公主。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor little rich girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.25,0:48:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她懂什么叫苦？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does she know about misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.63,0:48:03.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.63,0:48:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不是这么想的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, that's not what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.13,0:48:08.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在想的是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I was thinking was...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.55,0:48:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这姑娘到底经历了什么，才会觉得自己走投无路？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...what could have happened to this girl to make her think she had no way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.64,0:48:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well I...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.39,0:48:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是一切。是我的整个世界，还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was everything. It was my whole world and...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.65,0:48:21.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……里面的所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...all the people in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.40,0:48:25.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的人生就这么惯性向前冲，而我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the inertia of my life, plunging ahead and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.78,0:48:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……无力阻止。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...powerless to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.82,0:48:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，看那东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, look at that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.12,0:48:32.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会直接沉到海底。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You would have gone straight to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.99,0:48:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经发出500份请柬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}500 invitations have gone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.83,0:48:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费城上流社会的人都会到场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of Philadelphia society will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.79,0:48:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我一直觉得自己……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And all the while I feel I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.17,0:48:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……站在挤满人的房间里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...standing in the middle of a crowded room...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.17,0:48:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……声嘶力竭地尖叫……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...screaming at the top of my lungs...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.96,0:48:47.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……却没人抬头看一眼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and no one even looks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.01,0:48:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爱他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you love him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.34,0:48:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pardon me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.68,0:48:54.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爱他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you love him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.68,0:48:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太无礼了。你不该问我这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're being very rude. You shouldn't be asking me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.14,0:49:00.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个简单的问题。你到底爱不爱他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it's a simple question. Do you love the guy or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.15,0:49:05.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是合适的谈话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not a suitable conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.48,0:49:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么不能直接回答？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why can't you just answer the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.36,0:49:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.95,0:49:13.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不认识我，我也不认识你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know me and I don't know you...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.32,0:49:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我们根本没在谈这个。你无礼……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and we are not having this conversation at all. You are rude...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.54,0:49:19.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……粗俗又自以为是，我现在就走……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and uncouth and presumptuous and I am leaving now...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.21,0:49:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……杰克。道森先生。很高兴认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Jack. Mr. Dawson. It's been a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.21,0:49:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我特地来找你道谢，现在谢过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I sought you out to thank you and now I have thanked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.17,0:49:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你还侮辱了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you've insulted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.38,0:49:29.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你活该。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.22,0:49:30.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好吧。  -好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right.   -Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.39,0:49:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你要走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you were leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.22,0:49:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是要走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.73,0:49:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真烦人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.56,0:49:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.81,0:49:47.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不必走。这是我的地盘。你走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have to leave. This is my part of the ship. You leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.40,0:49:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀呀。现在是谁无礼了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, well. Now who's being rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.24,0:49:57.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你随身带的这破玩意儿是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this stupid thing you're carrying around?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.24,0:50:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你是干什么的，画家还是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what are you, an artist or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.75,0:50:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些画相当不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are rather good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.92,0:50:13.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实画得非常好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're very good, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.43,0:50:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，这画得真精美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack, this is exquisite work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.44,0:50:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴黎那边的人不太看得上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, they didn't think too much of them in old Paree.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.27,0:50:26.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴黎？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.90,0:50:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个穷……还挺能跑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do get around for a p--
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.28,0:50:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个……财力有限的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, a-- a person of limited means.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.28,0:50:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧。穷光蛋。你可以说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on. A poor guy. You can Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.62,0:50:43.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀呀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.63,0:50:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些都是写生画的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And these were drawn from life?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.80,0:50:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可是巴黎的好处之一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's one of the good things about Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.30,0:50:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多姑娘都愿意脱衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lots of girls are willing to take their clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.27,0:51:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢这个女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You liked this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.48,0:51:07.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你画了她好几次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You used her several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.82,0:51:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.57,0:51:12.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的手很美，看到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She had beautiful hands, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.99,0:51:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你一定和她有过一段情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you must have had a love affair with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.82,0:51:19.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不。只是和她的手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. Just with her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.16,0:51:22.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是个独腿妓女。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was a one-legged prostitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.96,0:51:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.50,0:51:33.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过她很有幽默感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She had a good sense of humor though.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.01,0:51:37.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，还有这位女士……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, and this lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.85,0:51:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她以前每晚都坐在那家酒吧……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She used to sit at this bar every night...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.02,0:51:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……把她所有的首饰都戴在身上……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wearing every piece of jewelry she owned...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.93,0:51:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就为了等她失散多年的爱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. Just waiting for her long, lost love.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.02,0:51:49.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们叫她珠宝夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We called her Madame Bijoux.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.86,0:51:51.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看，她的衣服都被虫蛀了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, her clothes are all moth-eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.36,0:51:56.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有天赋，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you have a gift, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.53,0:51:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.20,0:51:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能看透人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see people.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.99,0:52:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看透了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.95,0:52:05.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.66,0:52:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会跳下去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't have jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.71,0:52:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但上大学的目的就是找个合适的丈夫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the purpose of university is to find a suitable husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.55,0:52:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萝丝已经做到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose has already done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.55,0:52:21.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看，那个粗俗的布朗女人来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, here comes that vulgar Brown woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.72,0:52:24.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，趁她还没坐下，我们起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quickly, get up before she sits with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.39,0:52:28.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们好。我正想来找你们喝茶呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, girls. I was hoping I'd catch you at tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.23,0:52:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真抱歉，你来晚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're awfully sorry, you missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.90,0:52:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯爵夫人和我正要去甲板上透透气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Countess and I were just off to take the air on the boat deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.52,0:52:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好主意。我正好需要补补八卦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a lovely idea. I need to catch up on my gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.07,0:52:41.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯爵夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Countess.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.74,0:52:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你还没点燃最后四个锅炉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you've not yet lit the last four boilers?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.08,0:52:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我觉得没必要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't see the need.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.37,0:52:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们速度非常快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are making excellent time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.92,0:52:55.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}媒体已经知道泰坦尼克号有多大。现在我要他们惊叹她的速度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The press knows the size of Titanic. Now, I want them to marvel at her speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.55,0:52:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得给他们点新东西登报。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We must give them something new to print.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.76,0:53:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰坦尼克号的处女航必须……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This maiden voyage of Titanic must...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.26,0:53:03.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……上头条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...make headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.10,0:53:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊斯梅先生，我希望不要过度使用引擎……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Ismay, I would prefer not to push the engines...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.44,0:53:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……等它们充分磨合之后再说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...until they've been properly run in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.27,0:53:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，我只是个乘客。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course I'm just a passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.61,0:53:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该怎么做最合适，就交给您定夺了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I leave it to your good offices to decide what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.61,0:53:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但您最后一次横渡能有这样的收尾，多风光……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But what a glorious end to your final crossing...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.45,0:53:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……如果我们周二晚上就抵达纽约……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...If we were to get into New York on Tuesday night...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.24,0:53:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……让所有人都大吃一惊，上早报。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and surprise them all. Make the morning papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.58,0:53:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}风风光光地退休，是吧，E.J.？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Retire with a bang, eh, E.J.?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.29,0:53:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.04,0:53:35.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之后我在蒙特雷的捕鱿鱼船上打工……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After that, I worked on a squid boat in Monterey...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.96,0:53:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……然后我去了洛杉矶……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...then I went to Los Angeles to the...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.72,0:53:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在圣莫尼卡码头给人画肖像，一张十美分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Santa Monica pier and did portraits for 10 cents each.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.64,0:53:44.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么就不能像你一样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why can't I be like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.80,0:53:48.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想去哪儿就去哪儿，奔向地平线。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just head out for the horizon whenever I feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.31,0:53:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说好了，我们哪天要去那儿，去那个码头……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say we'll go there sometime, to that pier...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.31,0:53:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……哪怕只是嘴上说说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...only if we just talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.82,0:53:58.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我们真要去。我们喝便宜啤酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we'll do it. We'll drink cheap beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.99,0:54:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐过山车坐到吐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ride on the roller coaster till we throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.99,0:54:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在海滩上骑马，踏着浪花。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll ride horses on the beach, in the surf.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.49,0:54:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你得像真正的牛仔那样骑。不许侧着坐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you have to do it like a real cowboy. No sidesaddle stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.00,0:54:12.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说两条腿各在一边？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean with one leg on each side?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.00,0:54:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能教我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.25,0:54:17.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，如果你愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.67,0:54:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教我像男人那样骑马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Teach me to ride like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.59,0:54:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像男人那样嚼烟草。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chew tobacco like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.51,0:54:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有像男人那样吐口水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And spit like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.01,0:54:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在礼仪学校没学过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't learn in finishing school?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.02,0:54:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.52,0:54:31.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，我教你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, I'll Show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.35,0:54:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我教你怎么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll Show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.60,0:54:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！别，杰克，别。等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack! No, Jack, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.86,0:54:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的做不到，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't possibly, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.19,0:54:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.53,0:54:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.53,0:54:46.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轮到你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.87,0:54:51.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太差劲了。你得真使劲把它咳上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was pitiful. You really have to hawk it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.21,0:54:55.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用点力。手臂发力。脖子往后仰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get some leverage. Use your arms. Arc your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.54,0:54:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到能吐多远了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see the range on that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.38,0:55:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.05,0:55:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好多了。你还得练。真的用力咳上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was better. You have to work on it. Really try to hawk it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.98,0:55:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.74,0:55:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}允许我介绍一下杰克·道森吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I introduce Jack Dawson?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.24,0:55:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charmed, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.75,0:55:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其他人既客气又好奇，想认识这个救了我命的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The others were gracious and curious about the man who'd saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.59,0:55:42.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我妈看他的眼神就像看一只虫子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But my mother looked at him like an insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.09,0:55:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一只必须赶紧踩死的危险虫子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A dangerous insect which must be squashed quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.43,0:55:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来遇上麻烦时，身边有你这样的人倒不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds like you're a good man to have around in a sticky spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.27,0:55:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么他们总要像骑兵冲锋似的宣布开饭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do they always insist on announcing dinner like a damn cavalry charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.27,0:56:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去换衣服吧，妈妈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shall we go dress, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.94,0:56:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚饭见，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you at dinner, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.78,0:56:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，小伙子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.28,0:56:08.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小伙子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Son!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.95,0:56:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道自己在干什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any idea what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.29,0:56:13.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不太清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.62,0:56:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就要走进蛇窝了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're about to go into the snake pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.54,0:56:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算穿什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you going to wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.30,0:56:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道。跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I figured. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.97,0:56:32.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没说错吧。你和我儿子身材差不多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was right. You and my son are just about the same size.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.64,0:56:34.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差不多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.98,0:56:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打扮起来像枚新硬币一样锃亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shine up like a new penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.16,0:56:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.14,0:58:00.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这艘船里用了几千吨霍克利钢铁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thousands of tons of Hockley steel are in this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.14,0:58:03.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哪部分？  -该用的部分都用了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Which part?   -All the right ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.48,0:58:06.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那出了问题你可得负责。罗斯呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you're accountable if there's a problem. Where's Rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.90,0:58:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'll be along.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.57,0:58:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯爵夫人在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is the Countess.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.43,0:58:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在电影里见过，一直想试试。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw that in a nickelodeon and always wanted to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.37,0:58:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.12,0:59:01.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你一定记得道森先生吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...surely you remember Mr. Dawson.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.12,0:59:07.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真了不起。你几乎能冒充个绅士了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's amazing. You could almost pass for a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.96,0:59:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几乎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.46,0:59:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是非同寻常。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.48,0:59:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一次了不起的航行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a remarkable voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.40,0:59:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-疯了。  -彻底疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mad.   -Completely lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.57,0:59:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是罗西斯伯爵夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's the Countess of Rothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.66,0:59:38.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是约翰·雅各布·阿斯特……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's John Jacob Astor...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.33,0:59:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……船上最有钱的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the richest man on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.24,0:59:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的小妻子玛德琳跟我一样大，还有了身孕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His little wifey, Madeleine, is my age and in a delicate condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.00,0:59:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看她多想掩饰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See how she tries to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.25,0:59:49.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是桩丑闻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quite the scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.17,0:59:54.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本杰明·古根海姆和他的情妇奥贝尔夫人。古根海姆太太……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Benjamin Guggenheim and his mistress, Madame Aubert. Mrs. Guggenheim...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.92,0:59:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……当然在家带孩子。这边是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...iS at home with the children, of course. And over here...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.84,1:00:00.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……科斯莫爵士和露西尔，达夫-戈登夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Sir Cosmo and Lucile, Lady Duff-Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.76,1:00:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她设计性感内衣，那只是她众多才华之一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She designs naughty lingerie, among her many talents.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.35,1:00:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皇室成员可喜欢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very popular with the royals.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.69,1:00:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜。她很出色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations. She's splendid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.86,1:00:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.19,1:00:13.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意陪一位女士去用餐吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Escort a lady to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.86,1:00:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.70,1:00:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小甜豆，小甜豆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweet pea, sweet pea.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.53,1:00:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这没什么难的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ain't nothing to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.70,1:00:26.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就爱钱。你就装作家里有座金矿，就算进圈子了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They love money. Pretend like you own a gold mine and you're in the club.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.38,1:00:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，阿斯特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Astor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.88,1:00:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，莫莉。很高兴见到你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Molly. Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.80,1:00:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}J.J.，玛德琳，这位是杰克·道森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}J.J., Madeleine, I'd like you to meet Jack Dawson.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.14,1:00:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，杰克……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Jack...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.89,1:00:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你是波士顿道森家的人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...are you of the Boston Dawsons?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.56,1:00:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，其实我是奇佩瓦瀑布镇的道森家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, the Chippewa Falls Dawsons, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.39,1:00:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.73,1:00:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一定很紧张，但始终没有慌乱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He must have been nervous, but he never faltered.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.57,1:00:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们以为他和他们是一路人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They assumed he was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.07,1:00:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许是铁路大亨的继承人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heir to a railroad fortune, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.57,1:01:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然是暴发户，但还是俱乐部的成员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}New money, obviously, but still a member of the club.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.41,1:01:07.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，母亲总是不负所望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mother, of course, could always be counted upon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.42,1:01:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}道森先生，跟我们说说统舱的住宿条件吧。听说还挺不错的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell us of the accommodations in steerage, Mr. Dawson. I hear they're quite good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.84,1:01:18.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夫人，那是我见过最好的了。几乎没几只老鼠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The best I've seen, ma'am. Hardly any rats.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.09,1:01:23.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}道森先生是从三等舱来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Dawson is joining us from third class.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.18,1:01:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚他帮了我未婚妻的忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was of help to my fiancée last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.77,1:01:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}碰巧道森先生是个相当不错的画家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It happens Mr. Dawson is quite a fine artist.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.94,1:01:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他今天给我看了他的一些作品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He showed me some of his work today.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.94,1:01:37.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗斯和我在什么是好艺术上看法不同。我不是贬低你的作品，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose and I differ in our definition of fine art. Not to impugn your work, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.62,1:01:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些都是我的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are all these mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从外面开始，一圈圈往里来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Start from the outside and work in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.21,1:01:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他连船上每颗铆钉都清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He knows every rivet in her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.46,1:01:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安德鲁斯先生，您的船真是个奇迹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your ship is a wonder, Mr. Andrews.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.05,1:01:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，罗斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.55,1:02:03.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，您的鱼子酱要怎么吃？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you take your caviar, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.39,1:02:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不要鱼子酱，谢谢。我一直不太喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No caviar for me, thanks. Never did like it much.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.48,1:02:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}道森先生，你到底住在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where exactly do you live, Mr. Dawson?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.56,1:02:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼下我的住址就是泰坦尼克号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right now, my address is the RMS Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.81,1:02:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之后就看上帝的心情了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After that, I'm on God's good humor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.32,1:02:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你哪来的钱到处旅行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you have means to travel?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.15,1:02:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一路打工走过来的。坐些不定期的货轮什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I work my way from place to place. Tramp steamers and such.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.66,1:02:28.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在泰坦尼克号的船票是打扑克时靠一手好牌赢来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won my ticket on Titanic at a lucky hand at poker.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.58,1:02:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常走运的一手牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A very lucky hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.00,1:02:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人生本来就是一场运气游戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All life is a game of luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.17,1:02:37.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正的男人自己创造运气。对吧，道森？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A real man makes his own luck. Right, Dawson?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.76,1:02:42.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得那种漂泊不定的生活很有吸引力？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you find that sort of rootless existence appealing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.68,1:02:47.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，夫人，我觉得是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, ma'am, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.01,1:02:51.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要的一切都带在身上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got everything I need right here with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.27,1:02:54.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我肺里有空气，还有几张白纸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have air in my lungs and blank sheets of paper.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.52,1:02:59.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢早上醒来，不知道会发生什么，会遇到谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love waking up, not knowing what will happen or who I'll meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.86,1:03:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道最后会到哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where I'll wind up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.70,1:03:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚我还睡在桥底下……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One night I'm sleeping under a bridge...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.20,1:03:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……现在我就在全世界最豪华的船上，和你们这些体面人在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...now I'm on the grandest ship in the world, with you fine people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:10.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我再多喝点这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take more of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.04,1:03:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}生命是礼物，我可不想浪费。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Life's a gift. I don't intend on wasting it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.38,1:03:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你永远不知道会抓到什么牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You never know what hand you'll get dealt.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.21,1:03:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}生活给你什么，你就接什么。来，卡尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You take life as it comes at you. Here, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.47,1:03:26.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让每一天都有意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make each day count.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.97,1:03:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说得好，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well said, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.22,1:03:29.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说得好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear, hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.31,1:03:31.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为让每一天都有意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To making it count.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.56,1:03:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为让每一天都有意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To making it count.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.73,1:03:36.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.65,1:03:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可布朗先生不知道我把钱藏在了炉子里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Mr. Brown didn't know I'd hidden the money in the stove.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.74,1:03:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他庆祝完醉醺醺地回家，点了炉子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He comes home drunk as a pig celebrating and lights a fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.25,1:03:58.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来是去吸烟室喝白兰地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next is brandy in the smoking room.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.59,1:04:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们，来陪我喝杯白兰地？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Join me in a brandy, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.59,1:04:09.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他们退到一边，互相恭喜成为宇宙的主宰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now they retreat to congratulate each other on being masters of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.26,1:04:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，谢谢你们作陪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, thank you for your company.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.35,1:04:14.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以送您回舱房吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I escort you to the cabin?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.27,1:04:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用，我留在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.10,1:04:17.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你，莫莉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.10,1:04:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}道森，一起来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Joining us, Dawson?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.44,1:04:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不想跟女人们待在一起吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to stay with the women.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.28,1:04:25.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不了，谢谢。我得回去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, thanks. I have to head back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.94,1:04:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样最好。全是生意和政治，你不会感兴趣的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's best. It'll be all business and politics. Wouldn't interest you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.70,1:04:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}道森，你能来真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Dawson, good of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.96,1:04:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一定要走吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Must you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.54,1:04:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我该回去跟其他奴隶一起划桨了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time for me to row with the other slaves.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.47,1:04:48.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安，罗斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.84,1:05:31.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想去参加真正的派对吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want to go to a real party?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.77,1:05:43.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把手放这儿行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is okay I put my hand here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.54,1:06:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听不懂你说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.83,1:06:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在要跟她跳舞了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to dance with her now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.33,1:06:41.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.92,1:06:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.25,1:06:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。杰克，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack. Jack, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.42,1:06:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.67,1:06:51.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得再靠近一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll have to get a bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.76,1:06:52.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.26,1:06:57.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你永远是我最好的姑娘，科拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're still my best girl, Cora.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.18,1:07:04.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不会跳。  -我也不会。跟着感觉来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't know the steps.   -Me, either. Just go with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.77,1:07:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别多想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't think.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.29,1:07:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！杰克！等等！停下，杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait! Jack! Wait! Stop, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.80,1:07:39.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.51,1:08:22.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，不要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.02,1:08:31.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——超出了《谢尔曼法》的管辖范围。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}--beyond the jurisdiction of the Sherman Act.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:35.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洛克菲勒也这么说——最高法院可不买账。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what Rockefeller said-- Supreme Court didn't swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.05,1:08:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么？你以为头等舱的姑娘不会喝酒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You think a first-class girl can't drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.97,1:09:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}少来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.56,1:09:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.89,1:09:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.14,1:09:10.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三局两胜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two out of three.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.06,1:09:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.57,1:09:15.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你觉得自己很厉害？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you think you're tough?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.90,1:09:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你能不能做到这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see you do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.74,1:09:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，帮我拿着。举高点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold this for me, Jack. Hold it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.09,1:09:42.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.43,1:09:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.85,1:09:45.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我好多年没这么干过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't done that in years.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.52,1:09:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加油，伙计们。全力以赴。走起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, lads. Give it all you got. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.30,1:10:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，要咖啡吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coffee, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.56,1:10:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你昨晚没来找我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't come to me last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我累了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.49,1:10:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在下层甲板的那番折腾肯定累坏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your exertions below deck were no doubt exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.33,1:10:50.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看你让那个像殡仪馆工一样的男仆跟踪我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see you had that undertaker of a manservant follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.16,1:10:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你再也不许那样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will never behave like that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.67,1:11:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是你工厂里可以随便使唤的工头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not one of your mill foremen who you can command.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.18,1:11:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你的未婚妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.51,1:11:07.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的未婚妻。我的未婚妻！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My fiancée. My fiancée!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.85,1:11:09.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错！还是我的妻子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, you are! And my wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.18,1:11:15.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实际上就是我的妻子，就算法律上还不是，所以你得尊重我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My wife in practice, if not yet by law, so you will honor me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.02,1:11:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要像妻子尊重丈夫那样尊重我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will honor me the way a wife honors her husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.02,1:11:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我不会任人愚弄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I will not be made a fool of.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.11,1:11:23.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这有什么不清楚的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this in any way unclear?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.86,1:11:26.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.36,1:11:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。失陪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.37,1:11:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，露丝小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Miss Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.71,1:11:39.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们出了点小意外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had a little accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.54,1:11:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没关系。  -对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's all right.   -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.13,1:11:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.38,1:11:45.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系，小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right, miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.56,1:11:52.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系，小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right, miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.56,1:11:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上茶，特鲁迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tea, Trudy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.42,1:12:20.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不许再见那个男孩。明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not to see that boy again. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.92,1:12:24.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝，我不准。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose, I forbid it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.26,1:12:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说了，妈妈。你会把自己气到流鼻血。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it, Mother. You'll give yourself a nosebleed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.59,1:12:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是游戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.85,1:12:34.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的处境岌岌可危。你知道钱都没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our situation is precarious. You know the money's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.77,1:12:39.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然知道。你每天都提醒我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course I know. You remind me every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.19,1:12:45.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲除了一个好名声掩盖下的烂债，什么都没留给我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father left us nothing but a legacy of bad debts hidden by a good name.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.28,1:12:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个姓氏是我们唯一能打的牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That name is the only card we have to play.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.61,1:12:50.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真不明白你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.95,1:12:54.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟霍克利是门好亲事。能保证我们活下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is a fine match with Hockley. It will ensure our survival.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.29,1:12:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么能把这事推到我头上？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How can you put this on me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.21,1:12:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么这么自私？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you being so selfish?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.21,1:13:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自私？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm being selfish?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.55,1:13:08.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想看我去当女缝工吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to see me working as a seamstress?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.30,1:13:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就想这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.81,1:13:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着我们的好东西被拍卖？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To see our fine things sold at auction?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.31,1:13:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的回忆四散？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our memories scattered?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.32,1:13:33.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太不公平了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.33,1:13:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然不公平。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course it's unfair.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.50,1:13:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're women.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.34,1:13:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的选择从来都不容易。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our choices are never easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.36,1:14:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以你指引的手保护他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Protect them by Thy guiding hand
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.53,1:14:15.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}免于陆上的一切危险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From every peril on the land
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.37,1:14:21.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天父派来的圣灵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O, spirit whom the Father sent
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.04,1:14:26.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}铺展苍穹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To spread abroad the firmament
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.54,1:14:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天国之风，以你的力量\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O, wind of heaven, by Thy might
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.22,1:14:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拯救所有敢于如鹰飞翔的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Save all who dare the eagle's flight
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.39,1:14:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以你守望的关怀护佑他们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And keep them by Thy watchful care....
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.90,1:14:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，安德鲁斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Mr. Andrews.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.82,1:14:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得找个人谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to talk to someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.49,1:14:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不该来这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not supposed to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.42,1:15:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我昨晚来过，记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was here last night, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.25,1:15:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不记得。请你转身走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Now please turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.17,1:15:10.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会告诉你的。我只需要谈谈——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll tell you. I just need to talk--
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.26,1:15:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}霍克利先生和德维特·布卡特夫人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Hockley and Mrs. DeWitt Bukater...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.76,1:15:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……依然感激你的帮助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...are still appreciative of your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.93,1:15:20.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们让我把这个给你，以表谢意——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They asked me to give you this in gratitude--
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.68,1:15:22.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不要你的钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.60,1:15:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——并提醒你，你是三等舱的，你出现在这里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}--and remind you you are in third class and your presence here...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.69,1:15:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……已经不合适了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...S no longer appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.69,1:15:30.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我跟露丝说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me speak to Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.28,1:15:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们，请送道森先生回到他该待的地方……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen, please see Mr. Dawson returns to where he belongs...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.61,1:15:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……并且待在那儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and that he stays there?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.12,1:15:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.37,1:15:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come along, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.62,1:15:44.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当我们向你呼求时，请垂听\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear us when we cry to Thee
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.12,1:15:49.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为那些海上遇险的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For those in peril on the sea
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.63,1:15:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么有两个舵轮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are there two steering wheels?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.72,1:15:54.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠岸时用这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We use this one near shore.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.47,1:15:58.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，先生。又一份冰情警告，来自诺丹号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, sir. Another ice warning, from the Noordam.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.39,1:15:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，斯帕克斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Sparks.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.97,1:16:05.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。这个季节很正常。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to worry. Quite normal for this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.31,1:16:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上我们正在加速。我已下令点燃最后的锅炉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In fact, we're speeding up. I've ordered the last boilers lit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.36,1:16:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，孩子，像我教你的那样上紧。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, son, wind it up tight like I showed you. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.53,1:16:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，现在放开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, now let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.20,1:16:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不错吧？  -挺好的。非常好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It was good, wasn't it?   -Quite nice. That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.21,1:16:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安德鲁斯先生……恕我冒昧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Andrews...Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.84,1:16:36.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我脑子里算了算……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did the sum in my head...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.88,1:16:40.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……用救生艇数量乘以你说的载客量……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and with the number of lifeboats times the capacity you mentioned....
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.72,1:16:44.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恕我直言，好像不够船上所有人用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forgive me, but it seems that there are not enough for everyone aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.02,1:16:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实际上只够一半。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About half, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.56,1:16:49.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝，什么都逃不过你的眼睛，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose, you miss nothing, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.90,1:16:52.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上我装了这种新型吊艇架……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In fact, I put in these new type davits...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.40,1:16:55.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……能在这里面多放一排救生艇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...which can take an extra row of boats inside this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.74,1:16:57.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但有些人认为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it was thought, by some...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.86,1:16:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……甲板会显得太杂乱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the deck would look too cluttered.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.91,1:17:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我的意见被否决了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I was overruled.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.74,1:17:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正在一艘不沉船上，这是浪费甲板空间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a waste of deck space as it is on an unsinkable ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.08,1:17:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安心睡吧，小露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sleep soundly, young Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.87,1:17:10.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你造了一艘好船，坚固可靠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have built you a good ship, strong and true.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.75,1:17:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是你需要的全部救生艇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's all the lifeboat you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.75,1:17:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直往船尾走。下一站就是轮机舱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just keep heading aft. The next stop will be the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:25.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，这不可能。我看不见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack, this is impossible. I can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.72,1:17:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我得跟你谈谈。  -不，杰克。不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I need to talk to you.   -No, Jack. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.10,1:17:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。我订婚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack. I'm engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.44,1:17:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要嫁给卡尔了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm marrying Cal.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.11,1:17:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱卡尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love Cal.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.62,1:17:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你可不好伺候。知道吗？你甚至是个被宠坏的小丫头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you're no picnic. All right? You're a spoiled little brat even.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.45,1:17:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在那之下，你是最令人惊叹、最不可思议的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But under that, you're the most amazingly, astounding...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.29,1:17:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……最美好的女孩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wonderful girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.59,1:17:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……是我这辈子见过最美的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...woman, that I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.50,1:17:56.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack, I--
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.63,1:17:59.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，让我把话说完。你美——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, let me try and get this out. You're ama--
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.80,1:18:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是白痴，我知道这世界是怎么运转的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not an idiot. I know how the world works.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.14,1:18:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我口袋里只有十块钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got ten bucks in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.14,1:18:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么都给不了你，这我清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have nothing to offer you and I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.14,1:18:11.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.77,1:18:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我已经陷得太深了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm too involved now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.81,1:18:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跳，我也跳。记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You jump, I jump. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.15,1:18:19.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道你过得好不好，我没法走开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't turn away without knowing you'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.45,1:18:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想要这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's all that I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.82,1:18:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.49,1:18:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会很好的，真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be fine. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.00,1:18:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.33,1:18:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不这么认为。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.84,1:18:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把你困住了，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've got you trapped, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.13,1:18:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不挣脱出来，就会死掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're gonna die if you don't break free.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.63,1:18:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许不是马上……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe not right away...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.80,1:18:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……因为你很坚强……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...because you're strong...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.84,1:18:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但迟早，露丝，我爱的你身上那团火……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but sooner or later that fire that I love about you, Rose...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:50.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那团火会熄灭的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that fire is gonna burn out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.85,1:18:56.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救我轮不到你，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not up to you to save me, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.15,1:19:00.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.70,1:19:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有你自己能救自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only you can do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.37,1:19:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要回去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.20,1:19:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.22,1:19:27.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟露西尔说说你和文具商那场灾难。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell Lucile about the disaster you had with the stationers.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.68,1:19:30.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉，请柬当然得退回去，退了两回。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, of course the invitations had to be sent back, twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.56,1:19:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.02,1:19:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有那些糟糕的伴娘礼服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the dreadful bridesmaids' gowns.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.69,1:19:36.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你说，那可真是好一番折腾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me tell you what an odyssey that has been.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.23,1:19:38.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝决定要用淡紫色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose decided she wanted lavender.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.27,1:19:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她明知我最讨厌那个颜色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She knows I detest the color.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.90,1:19:42.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是故意气我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, she did it only to spite me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.40,1:19:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是早点来找我就好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If only you'd come to me sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.70,1:19:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝太太在《时尚画报》上看到过我的设计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ruth saw some of my designs in La Mode Ililustrée.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.74,1:19:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是给马尔堡公爵小女儿的嫁妆做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were for the trousseau of the Duchess of Marlborough's youngest daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.20,1:19:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were quite charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.29,1:19:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过亲爱的，我想你也同意，我们俩一起……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, I think you'll agree, my dear, that together...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.58,1:19:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……从灰烬里做出一只凤凰来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we've created something of a phoenix from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.56,1:20:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.27,1:20:21.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我改主意了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.07,1:20:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们说你可能会在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They said you might be up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.28,1:20:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.13,1:20:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在闭上眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.80,1:20:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.47,1:20:48.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，踩上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, step up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.81,1:20:54.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓住栏杆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, hold onto the railing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.18,1:20:56.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别睁眼，不许偷看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your eyes closed. Don't peek.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.44,1:20:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没偷看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.81,1:21:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在踩到栏杆上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, step up onto the rail.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.82,1:21:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧。抓紧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.32,1:21:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别睁眼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.66,1:21:10.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你信我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.49,1:21:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我信你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.67,1:21:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.05,1:21:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……睁开眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.64,1:21:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在飞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm flying.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.14,1:21:35.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.25,1:22:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，约瑟芬，坐上我的飞行器。往上飞……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come, Josephine, in my flying machine. Going up...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.21,1:22:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……她飞起来了，飞上去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...she goes. Up she goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.26,1:22:59.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是泰坦尼克号最后一次见到阳光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was the last time Titanic ever saw daylight.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.73,1:23:02.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在是沉船那晚的黄昏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're up to dusk the night of the sinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.65,1:23:04.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有六小时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}6 hours to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.10,1:23:08.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信。史密斯就站在那儿，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Incredible. There's Smith and he's standing there and...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.15,1:23:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他手上就攥着冰山警告……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he's got the iceberg warning in his fucking hand...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.07,1:23:13.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……抱歉——他手里，可他还下令加速。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...e@xcuse me--his hand, and he's ordering more speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.28,1:23:16.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二十六年的经验反而害了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}26 years of experience working against him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.74,1:23:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他觉得任何大到能弄沉这船的东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He figures anything big enough to sink, the ship...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.91,1:23:20.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……都能及时看见，来得及转舵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...they're gonna see in time to turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.95,1:23:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可船太大，舵太小。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the ship's too big with too small a rudder.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.58,1:23:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转弯根本不灵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doesn't corner worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.79,1:23:29.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他所知道的一切都是错的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything he knows is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.81,1:23:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证，这儿很合适。这是起居室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's quite proper, I assure you. This is the sitting room.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.65,1:23:49.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这光线行吗？  -什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Will this light do?   -What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.48,1:23:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}画家不是需要好光线吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't artists need good light?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.11,1:23:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，可我不习惯在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is true, but I'm not used to working in...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.11,1:23:56.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这么糟糕的条件下作画。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...such horrible conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.49,1:23:58.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莫奈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Monet!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.66,1:24:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你知道他的画？  -当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you know his work?   -Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.83,1:24:04.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看这色彩的运用，厉害吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at his use of color here. Isn't he great?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.96,1:24:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，太绝了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know. It's extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.46,1:24:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔非要到哪儿都带着这鬼东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cal insists on carting this hideous thing everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.46,1:24:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他很快会回来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should we be expecting him any time soon?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.64,1:24:19.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要雪茄和白兰地没断，他就不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not as long as the cigars and brandy hold out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.35,1:24:24.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.56,1:24:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是什么，蓝宝石？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it, a sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.19,1:24:28.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}钻石。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.98,1:24:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常罕见的钻石。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A very rare diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.19,1:24:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，我要你像画你那些法国姑娘一样画我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack, I want you to draw me like one of your French girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.20,1:24:39.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戴着这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wearing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.87,1:24:41.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.87,1:24:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只戴这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wearing only this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.28,1:25:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最不需要的就是再多一张我像瓷娃娃一样的画像。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The last thing I need is another picture of me looking like a porcelain doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.04,1:25:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为付钱的顾客……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As a paying customer...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.04,1:25:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我有权得到我想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... expect to get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.77,1:25:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到床上去……呃，沙发上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Over on the bed...uh, the couch.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.74,1:26:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，躺下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come. Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.25,1:26:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看着合适就告诉我。  -保持这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tell me when it looks right.   -Keep that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.96,1:26:11.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手臂放回原来的位置。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put your arm back the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.46,1:26:17.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把另一只手臂抬起来，手就放在脸旁边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put that other arm up, that hand right by your face there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.13,1:26:20.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.13,1:26:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，头低一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, head down.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.93,1:26:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼睛看着我，一直看着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eyes to me. Keep them on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.81,1:26:31.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽量别动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And try to stay still.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.50,1:26:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么严肃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.87,1:27:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看你脸红了，大艺术家先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe you are blushing, Mr. Big Artiste.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.38,1:27:44.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想象不出莫奈先生会脸红。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't imagine Monsieur Monet blushing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.55,1:27:47.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他画风景。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He does landscapes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.89,1:27:50.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-放松脸部。  -抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Just relax your face.   -Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.39,1:27:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不许笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No laughing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.76,1:28:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的心一直在狂跳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My heart was pounding the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.09,1:28:30.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我一生中最情色的时刻……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was the most erotic moment of my life...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.77,1:28:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……至少到那时为止。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...up until then, at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.60,1:28:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那后来呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what happened next?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.27,1:28:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说，我们有没有做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean, did we do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.44,1:28:46.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉让你失望了，博丁先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry to disappoint you, Mr. Bodine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.28,1:28:49.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克非常专业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack was very professional.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.79,1:28:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.09,1:29:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.30,1:29:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能帮我把这个放回保险箱吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you put this back in the safe for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.65,1:29:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们，失陪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen, would you excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.82,1:29:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乘务员都没见过她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of the stewards have seen her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.82,1:29:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太荒唐了。这可是艘船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is absurd. It's a ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.70,1:29:35.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她能去的地方有限。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's only so many places she could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.16,1:29:37.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洛夫乔伊，找到她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lovejoy, find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.14,1:29:56.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没人。  -是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Clear.   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.18,1:30:01.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没见过这么平静的海面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think I've ever seen such a flat calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.19,1:30:03.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像磨坊池塘一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a mill pond.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.36,1:30:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一丝风都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a breath of wind.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.03,1:30:10.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样冰山会更难看清……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It will make the bergs harder to see...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.36,1:30:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……因为底部没有激起的浪花。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with no breaking water at the base.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.84,1:30:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.92,1:30:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持速度和航向，莱托勒先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maintain speed and heading, Mr. Lightoller.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.84,1:30:30.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.39,1:30:43.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天变冷了。你很好看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's getting cold. You look nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.06,1:30:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss Rose?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.90,1:30:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的画！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My drawings!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.59,1:31:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.93,1:31:20.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，等等，等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.89,1:31:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-走，走，下去，下去。  -带我们下去，快，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Go. Go. Down, down.   -Take us down, quickly. Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.07,1:31:32.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.95,1:31:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.63,1:31:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-继续走。  -谢谢，我来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep going.   -Thank you, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.60,1:32:00.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这人对贴身男仆来说挺凶的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretty tough for a valet, this fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.52,1:32:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更像是个警察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seems more like a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.48,1:32:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得他以前就是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.31,1:32:05.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-妈的。  -走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, shit.   -Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.82,1:32:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，这边！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.65,1:32:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.33,1:32:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.29,1:32:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.84,1:32:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一号炉需要加煤，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More coal for number one, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.80,1:32:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，你们两个在这下面干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold up? What are you two doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.84,1:32:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不该来这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shouldn't be down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.18,1:32:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里很危险！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It could be dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.64,1:32:41.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续干！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Carry on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.02,1:32:43.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管我们。你们干得很好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't mind us. You're doing a great job!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.06,1:32:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续保持！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep up the good work!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.87,1:33:03.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我们找到了什么，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at what we have here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.06,1:33:23.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.07,1:33:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去哪儿，小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where to, miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.07,1:33:39.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去星星那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To the stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.76,1:34:00.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你紧张吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.72,1:34:03.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.78,1:34:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手放在我身上，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put your hands on me, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.81,1:34:48.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真他妈冷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's bloody cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.81,1:34:52.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我能闻到冰的味道，冰靠近的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I can smell ice, you know. When it's near.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.65,1:34:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bollocks!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.32,1:34:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的能闻到，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I can, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.32,1:34:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你找到给瞭望员的望远镜了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you ever find those binoculars for the lookouts?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.65,1:35:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从南安普顿起就没见过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Haven't seen them since Southampton.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.16,1:35:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我继续巡逻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'll be on my rounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.45,1:35:05.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheerio.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.69,1:35:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在发抖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're trembling.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.48,1:35:41.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.65,1:35:43.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.72,1:36:06.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们往那边跑了。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-They ran down there.   -Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.31,1:36:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}少了什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything missing?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.01,1:36:44.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个更好的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.69,1:36:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓到你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.11,1:37:10.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到那些人的表情了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see those guys' faces?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.53,1:37:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see them?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.71,1:37:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等船靠岸……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When the ship docks...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.88,1:37:24.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我就跟你一起下船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I'm getting off with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.72,1:37:27.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这太疯狂了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.22,1:37:30.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。这完全说不通。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.55,1:37:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我才相信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why I trust it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.06,1:37:44.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.57,1:37:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看看那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at that, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.90,1:37:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们比我们还暖和。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're warmer than we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.82,1:37:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果必须靠那样才能取暖，我宁愿不要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If that's what it takes for us to get warm, I'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.42,1:38:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bugger me!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.26,1:38:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快接电话，你们这些混蛋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pick up, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.43,1:38:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is anyone there?!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.68,1:38:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.10,1:38:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冰山，正前方！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Iceberg, right ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.77,1:38:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.19,1:38:27.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前方有冰山！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Iceberg ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.36,1:38:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}右满舵！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard a' starboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.28,1:38:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转！转！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn! Turn! Smartly!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.79,1:38:44.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全速倒车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Full astern!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.13,1:38:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}满舵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard over.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.30,1:38:49.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}满舵，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Helm's hard over, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.64,1:38:55.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，伙计们，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, lads, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.56,1:39:00.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把蒸汽压下去！压下去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring that steam down! Bring it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.14,1:39:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关闭所有风门！关上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut all the dampers! Shut them!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.82,1:39:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.66,1:39:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.07,1:39:16.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在！启动倒车引擎！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now! Engage reversing engine!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.86,1:39:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么还没转？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why ain't they turning?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.61,1:39:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是满舵吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ls it hard over?!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.02,1:39:51.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，先生。满舵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is, sir. Hard over.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.03,1:39:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转啊，转啊，转啊。转！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on, come on. Turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.38,1:40:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.89,1:40:18.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要撞上了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's going to hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.98,1:40:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.26,1:40:53.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.67,1:40:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}左满舵！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.10,1:41:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.05,1:41:38.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.63,1:41:41.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在关门！快出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're closing the doors! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.48,1:41:50.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从门出去！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out the door! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.15,1:41:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！伙计们，快！快，伙计们，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Come on, lads! Go, lads, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.83,1:42:05.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.00,1:42:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去！出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.68,1:42:24.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.18,1:42:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was a close shave.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.85,1:42:29.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闻到冰味了吧？我的天！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smell ice, can you? Bleedin' Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.86,1:42:36.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记下时间。写进航海日志。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Note the time. Enter it in the log.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.45,1:42:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事，默多克先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was that, Mr. Murdoch?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.03,1:42:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是冰山，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An iceberg, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.54,1:42:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打了右满舵，但太近了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I put her hard to starboard, but it was too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.37,1:42:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我试着左转绕开，但——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tried to port round it, but--
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.88,1:42:57.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-关闭水密门。  -已经关了，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Close the watertight doors.   -They're closed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.22,1:43:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.73,1:43:12.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让木匠测量船体。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have the carpenter sound the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.57,1:43:27.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，赶紧离开这鬼地方！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, let's get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.75,1:43:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}引擎怎么停了？我感觉船震了一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why have the engines stopped? I felt a shudder.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.84,1:43:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。我们掉了一片螺旋桨叶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to worry. We threw a propeller blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.75,1:43:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你才感觉震动。需要什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the shudder you felt. Do you need anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.42,1:43:43.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.43,1:43:50.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说撞上冰山了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's talk of an iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.18,1:43:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么也没看到。你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't see anything. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.10,1:43:58.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是老鼠都往那跑，我也去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If this is where the rats are going, I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.28,1:44:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你。  -没有紧急情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You.   -There is no emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.20,1:44:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-有。我被偷了。  -叫宪兵长来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-There is. I've been robbed.   -Get the Master at Arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.62,1:44:12.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去，你这笨蛋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.96,1:44:18.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我错过好戏了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I miss the fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.46,1:44:23.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你看到怎么回事了吗？  -没有。好像是那边撞的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you see what happened?   -No. I guess it hit over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.30,1:44:28.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六号锅炉房进水八英尺，邮件舱更糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boiler room six is flooded eight feet and the mail hold is worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.80,1:44:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-能撑住吗？  -除非水泵能排得过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Can you shore up?   -Not unless the pumps get ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.47,1:44:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看过邮件舱吗？  -已经在水下了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Have you seen the mail hold?   -It's already underwater.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.23,1:44:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}情况不妙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.23,1:44:40.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们该告诉母亲和卡尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should tell Mother and Cal.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.90,1:44:43.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得画得很好，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think they're very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.82,1:44:49.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都别碰。把这房间拍下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't touch anything. I want the room photographed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.83,1:44:57.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一直在找你，小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've been looking for you, miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.84,1:45:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.84,1:45:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出大事了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something serious has happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.85,1:45:13.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, it has.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.85,1:45:18.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实。我两件心爱的东西不见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed. Two things dear to me have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.52,1:45:22.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在一件回来了，我就知道另一件在哪。搜他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now that one is back, I know where to find the other. Search him.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.94,1:45:24.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把外套脱了。  -又怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take your coat off.   -Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.94,1:45:29.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们干什么？现在正有紧急情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing? We're in the middle of an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.20,1:45:32.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是这个吗？  -就是这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Is this it?   -That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.87,1:45:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直是胡扯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is horseshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.04,1:45:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别信这套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.71,1:45:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他不可能干这事。  -对老手来说轻而易举。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He couldn't have.   -Easy enough for a professional.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.29,1:45:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直和他在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was with him the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.05,1:45:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许是在你穿衣服的时候干的，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps he did it while you were putting your clothes back on, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.72,1:45:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真狡猾。他们塞进我口袋的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Real slick. They put it in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.22,1:45:54.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-闭嘴。  -这根本不是你的口袋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shut up.   -It isn't even your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.31,1:45:55.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“A.L. 赖尔森之物。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Property of A.L. Ryerson."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.14,1:46:01.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人报过失窃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was reported stolen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.90,1:46:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是借来戴戴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just borrowed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.73,1:46:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我们有个诚实的贼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, we have an honest thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.40,1:46:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道不是我干的，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I didn't do this, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.40,1:46:11.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别信他们。你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't believe them. You know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.66,1:46:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.91,1:46:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道不是我干的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.08,1:46:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好孩子。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a good lad. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.41,1:46:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道不是我干的！你了解我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I didn't do it! You know me!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.67,1:46:24.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太不幸了，船长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is most unfortunate, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.42,1:46:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十分钟内水就高过龙骨十四英尺……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Water fourteen feet above the keel in ten minutes...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.09,1:46:35.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在艏尖舱、三个货舱和六号锅炉房。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in the forepeak, all three holds and boiler room six.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.68,1:46:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.93,1:46:38.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们什么时候能继续航行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When can we get underway?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.52,1:46:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是五个隔舱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's five compartments.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.44,1:46:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破四个隔舱还能浮着，五个就不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She can float with four compartments breached, but not five.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.11,1:46:50.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五个不行。船下沉时，水会漫过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not five. As she goes down, the water will spill...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.03,1:46:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……E甲板舱壁顶部，一个接一个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...over the tops of the bulkheads at E deck, one to the next...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.45,1:46:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一路往后。止不住的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...back and back. There's no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.45,1:46:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水泵呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pumps.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.96,1:47:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水泵能争取时间，但只有几分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pumps buy you time, but minutes only.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.79,1:47:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从现在起，无论我们做什么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As of now, no matter what we do...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.96,1:47:09.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……泰坦尼克号都会沉没。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Litanic will founder.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.47,1:47:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这船不可能沉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this ship can't sink.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.05,1:47:15.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是铁做的。我向你保证，她会沉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's made of iron. I assure you, she can.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.47,1:47:17.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且一定会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she will.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.31,1:47:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是数学上的必然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a mathematical certainty.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.81,1:47:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有多少时间？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How much time?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.82,1:47:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一小时，最多两小时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An hour. Two, at most.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.33,1:47:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船上多少人，默多克先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How many aboard, Mr. Murdoch?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.83,1:47:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两千两百人，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two thousand, two hundred souls, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.34,1:47:57.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，伊斯梅先生，我想你要上头条了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I believe you may get your headlines, Mr. Ismay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.36,1:48:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真是个小荡妇，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it is a little slut, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.37,1:48:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说话时看着我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at me when I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.79,1:48:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-霍克利先生？  -现在不行，我们忙着呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mr. Hockley?   -Not now. We're busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.20,1:48:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请您穿上救生衣，到艇甲板去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been asked to put on lifebelts and go to the boat deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.88,1:48:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了，现在不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said, not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.13,1:48:33.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，霍克利先生，但这是船长的命令。穿暖和点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Mr. Hockley, but it's Captain's orders. Dress warmly.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.38,1:48:35.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面很冷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's quite cold out.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.88,1:48:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}建议您穿上大衣，戴上帽子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I suggest topcoats and hats?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.05,1:48:40.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是荒唐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.56,1:48:45.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心，小姐，我肯定这只是预防措施。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to worry, miss. I'm sure it's just a precaution.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.56,1:48:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都起来！穿上救生衣！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody up! Lifebelts on!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.23,1:48:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's he on about?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.73,1:48:53.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-穿上救生衣！  -怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Put your lifebelts on!   -What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.82,1:48:55.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿上就是了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just put them on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.40,1:48:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}C.Q.D.？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}C.Q.D.?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.24,1:48:59.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.08,1:49:04.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，C.Q.D.，求救信号。这是我们的位置。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right, C.Q.D. The distress call. That's our position.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.50,1:49:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉回应的人，我们正在下沉，需要立即救援。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell whoever responds we're going down and need immediate assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.27,1:49:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blimey.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.78,1:49:39.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续放！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep lowering!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.79,1:49:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住！拉紧！绞出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Steady! Make it taut! And winch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.46,1:49:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}揭开这条艇的帆布！揭开船尾所有救生艇的帆布！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uncover this boat! Uncover all the boats aft!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.80,1:49:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解开那些绳索！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Release those ties!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.80,1:50:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把帆布卷起来！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roll back that cover! Smartly now!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.14,1:50:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乘客呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are the passengers?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.89,1:50:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们进去了。外面又冷又吵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They went inside. Too cold and noisy for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.48,1:50:10.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你！下来帮忙拉这些绳索！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You there! Get down here and help with these lines!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.99,1:50:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要来一杯吗，先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Care for a drink, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.33,1:50:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小伙子，怎么回事？给我们穿上这玩意儿，现在又让我们干等着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sonny, what's doing? You get us all trussed up and now we're cooling our heels.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.50,1:50:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，太太。我去问问。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, ma'am. Let me go find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.67,1:50:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人知道怎么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody knows what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.26,1:50:43.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像该死的英国人——什么都按规矩来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like the damn English--everything by the book.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.43,1:50:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没必要说脏话，霍克利先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No need for language, Mr. Hockley.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.35,1:50:51.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回去把我们房间的暖气打开。我回来时要喝杯茶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go back and turn on the heaters in our rooms. I want a cup of tea when I return.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.03,1:51:03.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安德鲁斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Andrews.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.03,1:51:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见冰山了。也从你眼里看出来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw the iceberg. And I see it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.70,1:51:10.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请告诉我实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.55,1:51:20.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船会沉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ship will sink.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.13,1:51:23.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're certain?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.22,1:51:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个小时左右，这一切都会沉到大西洋底。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In an hour or so, all this will be at the bottom of the Atlantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.73,1:51:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请只告诉必须告诉的人。我不想引起恐慌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, tell only who you must. I don't want to cause a panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.40,1:51:39.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后上救生艇。快，别等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And get to a boat. Quickly. Don't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.90,1:51:43.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你记得我跟你说的救生艇的事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You remember what I told you about the boats?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.41,1:51:46.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.58,1:51:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.09,1:51:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Over here, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.42,1:52:03.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，二等舱事务长办公室外聚了一大群人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, there's a big mob at the Second Class Purser's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.93,1:52:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧，我看着他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on. I'll watch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.43,1:52:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.11,1:52:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，卡帕西亚号说他们航速17节。他们正全速赶来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, Carpathia says they're making 17 knots. Full steam for them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.95,1:52:30.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有她回应？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the only one responding?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.62,1:52:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有她离得近。他们四小时后到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only one close. They'll be here in four hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.96,1:52:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}四小时？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Four hours?!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.63,1:52:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，布莱德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Bride.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.47,1:52:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.65,1:53:00.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救生艇已放下就位，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are swung out and ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.15,1:53:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是不是该让妇女和儿童上艇了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hadn't we better get the women and children into the boats?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.99,1:53:08.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.16,1:53:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妇女儿童优先，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women and children first, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.83,1:53:19.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.00,1:53:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们先生们，请注意！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies and gentlemen, attention, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.17,1:53:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请往这边走。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step this way, please. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.01,1:53:30.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到我这边来。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come towards me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.85,1:53:32.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.10,1:53:37.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目前我只让妇女和儿童上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For the time being, I require only women and children.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.85,1:53:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.69,1:53:43.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像船长说的，好好说，别让大家恐慌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like the Captain said, nice and cheery, so there's no panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.69,1:53:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《婚礼舞曲》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Wedding Dance."
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.41,1:53:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿上救生衣。穿上救生衣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lifebelts on. Put your lifebelts on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.37,1:54:00.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿上救生衣。穿上救生衣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put your lifebelts on. Lifebelt on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.38,1:54:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，把救生衣穿上。转过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, put that lifebelt on. Turn it around.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.72,1:54:11.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还没到上救生艇的时候！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It isn't time to go to the boats yet!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.39,1:54:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请保持冷静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.39,1:54:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确保你们都穿上了救生衣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make sure you have your lifebelts on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.89,1:54:19.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让妇女和儿童到前面来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let women and children through to the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.56,1:54:20.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.15,1:54:24.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等着。等头等舱的人上了艇……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waiting. Once first-class people are in the boats...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.48,1:54:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就轮到我们了，我们得准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...they'll start with us and we want to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.99,1:54:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}推挤也不会让你更快出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pushing won't get you out any faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.57,1:54:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去找人帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go get help.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.24,1:54:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放艇，左右一起！稳住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lower it away, left and right together! Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.91,1:54:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两边一起！稳住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Both sides together! Steady!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.25,1:54:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Steady!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.59,1:54:47.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停，停，停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.42,1:54:49.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}左边别动！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold the left!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.92,1:54:52.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只放右边！只放右边！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right side only! Right side only!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.76,1:54:53.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}右边！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right side!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.26,1:54:58.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}左边别动！右边下！一起放！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold the left! Right side down! Lower away together!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.27,1:55:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住，小伙子们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Steady, lads!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.32,1:55:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我真觉得这船会沉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I do believe this ship may sink.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.82,1:55:59.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人让我把这个交给您，聊表谢意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been asked to give you this small token of our appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.00,1:56:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡利登·霍克利先生的一点心意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Compliments of Mr. Caledon Hockley.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.42,1:56:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，妹子，听到那人说的了。上艇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, sister, you heard the man. Into the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.43,1:56:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们，还有位置给一位绅士吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any room for a gentleman, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.76,1:56:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在只能上妇女，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only women at this time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.43,1:56:23.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救生艇是按舱位安排座位的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will the lifeboats be seated according to class?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.73,1:56:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望别太挤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope they're not too crowded.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.23,1:56:31.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈，闭嘴吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Mother, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.94,1:56:33.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还不明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.61,1:56:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海水冰冷刺骨，船又不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The water is freezing and there aren't enough boats.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.61,1:56:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连一半都不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not enough by half.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.12,1:56:40.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这船上有一半人都会死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Half the people on this ship are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.95,1:56:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}死的不会是上等的那一半。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not the better half.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.46,1:56:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，露丝，上船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Ruth, get in the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.08,1:56:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}头等舱的位子就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First class seats are right up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.13,1:56:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可惜我没留下那幅画。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's a pity I didn't keep that drawing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.09,1:56:52.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到早上它可值钱多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be worth a lot more by morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.64,1:56:59.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个不可理喻的混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You unimaginable bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.10,1:57:02.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，露丝亲爱的，你的位子多的是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Rose darling. There's plenty of room for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.98,1:57:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.52,1:57:07.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轮到你了，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're next, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.48,1:57:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上船吧，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come into the boat, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.11,1:57:12.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.44,1:57:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.32,1:57:15.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快上船！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get into the boat!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.11,1:57:18.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.28,1:57:20.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good-bye, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.62,1:57:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.83,1:57:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去找他？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To him?!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.79,1:57:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去做那个小混混的妓女？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To be a whore to a gutter rat?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.50,1:57:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我宁愿做他的妓女，也不做你的妻子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd rather be his whore than your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.22,1:57:38.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.05,1:57:41.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了，不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.35,1:57:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝！求你，站住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose! Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.98,1:57:47.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，放下去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, lower away!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.64,1:57:49.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.73,1:57:50.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lower away!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.81,1:57:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-露丝！  -两边一起放！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rose!   -Lower together!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.36,1:57:54.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉住左边！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold the left side!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.66,1:57:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救命！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.53,1:58:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人能听见我吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can anybody hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.04,1:58:05.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！救救我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.54,1:58:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救救我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.37,1:58:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能听见我吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.71,1:58:14.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人能听见我吗？！谁来救救我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can anybody hear me?! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.88,1:58:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安德鲁斯先生？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Andrews?!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.05,1:58:23.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乘务员，检查右舷走廊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Steward, check the starboard corridor.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.51,1:58:26.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夫人，请穿上救生衣，马上去救生艇甲板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madame, please put on a lifebelt. Get to the boat deck immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.56,1:58:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露西，看在上帝的份上，穿上救生衣，给大家做个榜样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lucy, for God's sake put on your lifebelt and set a good example.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.27,1:58:30.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.90,1:58:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-里面有人吗？  -安德鲁斯先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Anyone in here?   -Mr. Andrews!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.56,1:58:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安德鲁斯先生！谢天谢地！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Andrews! Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.69,1:58:37.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纠察长会把被捕的人带到哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where would the Master at Arms take someone under arrest?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.61,1:58:38.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你必须马上上救生艇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You have to get to a boat right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.03,1:58:40.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.07,1:58:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，不管你帮不帮忙，这事我都要做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm doing this with or without your help, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.91,1:58:43.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但没人帮忙会更慢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But without will take longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.87,1:58:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐电梯到最底层，往左走……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the elevator to the very bottom. Go to the left...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.20,1:58:50.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……沿着船员通道下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..down the crewmen's passage.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.42,1:58:53.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后在楼梯那儿右转，再左转。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then go right and left again at the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.29,1:58:54.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会走到一条长走廊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll come to a long corridor.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.42,1:59:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不太妙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This could be bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.93,1:59:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的！妈的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, shit! Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.94,1:59:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}借过，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.44,1:59:21.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，小姐，电梯关了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, miss, but the lifts are closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.28,1:59:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈不客气了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm through being polite, goddamnit!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.24,1:59:26.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上带我下去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now take me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.62,1:59:28.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}E甲板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}E deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.29,1:59:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.08,1:59:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.27,1:59:54.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要上去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.65,1:59:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！不！不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.98,2:00:02.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来！我要上去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back! I'm going back up!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.15,2:00:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要上去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going back up!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.16,2:00:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船员通道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crew passage.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.52,2:00:38.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.33,2:00:52.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.75,2:00:56.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝，我在这儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose, I'm in here!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.75,2:00:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in here!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.63,2:00:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in here!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.92,2:01:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.26,2:01:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，真对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.59,2:01:08.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是洛夫乔伊那家伙塞进我口袋的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That guy Lovejoy put it in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.01,2:01:10.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，我知道，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.01,2:01:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，露丝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen Rose...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.18,2:01:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你得找到备用钥匙，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you're gonna have to find the spare key, all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.68,2:01:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看那边那个柜子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look in that cabinet right there.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.56,2:01:19.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是把小银钥匙，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a little silver one, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.07,2:01:23.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些都是铜的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are all brass ones!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.44,2:01:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这儿，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check right here, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.53,2:01:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.87,2:01:34.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道不是我干的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you find out I didn't do it?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.91,2:01:35.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.04,2:01:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是发现我早就知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just realized I already knew.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.63,2:01:41.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续找。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.97,2:01:52.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没钥匙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No key.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.56,2:01:53.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有钥匙！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no key!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.64,2:01:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，露丝，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, Rose, listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.97,2:01:56.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得去叫人帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna have to go find some help.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.23,2:01:58.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.65,2:02:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.66,2:02:14.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就在这儿等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just wait here!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.80,2:02:29.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello? Is there anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.22,2:02:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.84,2:02:33.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下面有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anybody down here?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.68,2:02:36.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要帮忙！有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need help! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.18,2:02:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damnit!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.69,2:02:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人能听到我吗？！喂？！喂？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can anybody hear me, please?! Hello?! Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.53,2:02:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢天谢地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.20,2:02:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，求你，我需要你帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, please, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.62,2:02:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后面有个人，他被——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a man back here and he's--
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.49,2:02:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.71,2:03:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.82,2:03:29.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.32,2:03:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小姐，你现在不该在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss, you shouldn't be here now.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.11,2:03:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.70,2:03:36.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下面有个人，他被困住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is a man down here and he is trapped.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.66,2:03:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这边，对。好的。  -求你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This way, yes. All right.   -Please!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.99,2:03:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没必要惊慌。  -不，我没惊慌！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-There's no need to panic.   -No, I'm not panicking!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.08,2:03:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走错方向了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.25,2:03:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我！听我说！！！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go of me! Listen!!!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.67,2:03:50.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To hell with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.63,2:04:30.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.18,2:05:23.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这能行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will this work?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.68,2:05:25.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}试试就知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess we'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.44,2:05:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.52,2:05:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，等等，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.19,2:05:33.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那边试挥几下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try a couple practice swings over there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.91,2:05:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.20,2:05:42.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在试着再砍中同一个位置，露丝。你能行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now try and hit the same mark again, Rose. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.71,2:05:52.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，练够了。来吧，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, that's enough practice. Come on, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.34,2:05:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.21,2:05:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，用尽全力，快速砍下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, just hit it really hard and really fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.26,2:06:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.64,2:06:02.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}手再张开一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open your hands up a little more.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.22,2:06:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这样？  -对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Like that?   -Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.56,2:06:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，露丝，我相信你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, Rose, I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.56,2:06:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.91,2:06:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你成功了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did it!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.57,2:06:22.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.58,2:06:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的，真冷！妈的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh shit, this is cold! Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.91,2:06:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的！妈的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.09,2:06:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边是出口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the way out.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.25,2:06:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得另找出路。快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to find another way. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.80,2:06:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.84,2:06:43.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用力拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put your backs into it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.81,2:06:50.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.77,2:06:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不常见啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, there's something you don't see every day.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.46,2:07:19.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些行李怎么在这儿？扔出去。扔出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this luggage doing here? Get rid of it. Get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.42,2:07:20.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要空间。扔出去。搬走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need the room. Get rid of that. Out.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.38,2:07:25.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边。先生，放手。退后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way. Let go, sir. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.64,2:07:26.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持镇静！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep calm!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.31,2:07:35.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洛夫乔伊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lovejoy!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.69,2:07:37.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}右舷那边也没有她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not on the starboard side either.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.98,2:07:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们时间不多了。这个神气活现的死板军官根本不让男人上船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're running out of time. This strutting martinet isn't letting any men on at all.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.66,2:07:44.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另一边有个军官让男人上船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's one on the other side letting men on.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.32,2:07:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就这么办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well then, that's our play.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.78,2:07:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得先弄点保险。走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll need some insurance first. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.33,2:07:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边，请。一直往里走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way, please. All the way down here.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.50,2:07:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.71,2:07:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.50,2:08:01.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，那得赔的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll have to pay for that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.76,2:08:03.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是白星航运的财产。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's White Star Line property.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.84,2:08:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.18,2:08:09.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能把船停一下吗？我得回房间拿——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you hold the boat a moment? I just have to run back to my room--
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.18,2:08:11.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.85,2:08:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是最后一艘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the last.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.06,2:08:14.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-准备放船。  -莱托勒先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Prepare to lower.   -Mr. Lightoller.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.98,2:08:16.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么船装一半就放下去了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are the boats being launched half full?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.19,2:08:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在别说这个，安德鲁斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not now, Mr. Andrews.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.44,2:08:21.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看。能装六十五人的船，只坐了二十来个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There, look. 20 or so in a boat built for 65?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.86,2:08:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还看到一艘只坐了十二人。十二个！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I saw one boat with only 12. 12!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.20,2:08:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不确定重量，安德鲁斯先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we weren't sure of the weight, Mr. Andrews.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.45,2:08:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些船可能会断裂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These boats may buckle.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.78,2:08:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rubbish!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.04,2:08:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些船在贝尔法斯特用七十人的重量测试过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were tested in Belfast with the weight of 70 men.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.12,2:08:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把船装满，莱托勒先生。看在上帝的份上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, fill these boats, Mr. Lightoller. For God's sake man!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.88,2:08:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请再来些女人和孩子，拜托！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, I need more women and children, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.06,2:08:52.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退回去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back in there!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.56,2:08:55.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是出口。这不是出口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not an exit. This is not an exit.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.65,2:09:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能把我们锁在这里。像牲口一样。船都要沉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't keep us locked in here. Like animals. The ship's bloody sinking.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.57,2:09:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让女人上前！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring forward the women!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.90,2:09:05.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打开闸门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unlock the gates.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.24,2:09:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只准女人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women only!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.91,2:09:12.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男人不行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No men!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.92,2:09:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.09,2:09:21.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.25,2:09:22.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}锁上闸门！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lock the gates!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.42,2:09:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他们从闸门那儿赶回去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get them back from those gates!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.18,2:09:27.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别碰闸门！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't touch the gates!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.10,2:09:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天啊，你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For God's sake, man...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.60,2:09:34.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……下面还有女人和孩子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..there are women and children down here!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.43,2:09:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放我们上去，给我们一条活路！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let us up So we can have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.81,2:09:38.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.57,2:09:43.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤米！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.78,2:09:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-能出去吗？  -那边没希望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Can we get out?   -It's hopeless that way.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.61,2:09:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管做什么，都得快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever we do, we've got to do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.78,2:09:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船都要开走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The boats are all going.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.54,2:09:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里全在进水。我们得离开这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This whole place is flooding. We've gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.45,2:09:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边什么都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is niente this way.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.62,2:09:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走这边，好吗？快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go this way, all right? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.96,2:10:05.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的运气自己造。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I make my own luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.46,2:10:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So do l.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.81,2:10:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.64,2:10:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，快，走这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, come on, let's go this way.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.24,2:10:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.28,2:10:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回主楼梯去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go back to the main stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.82,2:10:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到那儿一切都会解决的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And everything will be sorted out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.58,2:10:36.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回到那边就都解决了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It will all get sorted out back there.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.79,2:10:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回主楼梯去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go back to the main stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.04,2:10:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-开门！  -回主楼梯去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Open the gate!   -Go back down the main stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.25,2:10:41.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上把门打开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open the gate right now!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.83,2:10:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}照我说的，回主楼梯去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go back down the main stairwell, like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.17,2:10:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！狗娘养的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn it! Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.01,2:10:50.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.60,2:10:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法布里、汤米，过来帮我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fabri, Tommy, give me a hand here.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.72,2:10:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move aside.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.81,2:10:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，用力拉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, pull!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.85,2:11:00.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.85,2:11:03.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开。快点，让开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move aside. Quickly, move aside!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.27,2:11:04.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那个放下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.36,2:11:05.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-让开！  -把那个放下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Move aside!   -Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.69,2:11:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一！二！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One! Two!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.94,2:11:09.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.36,2:11:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Again!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.53,2:11:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.91,2:11:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.04,2:11:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不能上去！不能这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't go up there! You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.55,2:11:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持秩序！这边保持秩序！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep order! Keep order here!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.72,2:11:32.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！退后！退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back! Back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.14,2:11:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓住她！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on to her!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.72,2:11:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她拉上来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull her in!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.73,2:11:44.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后，我说了，不然我就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back, I say, or I'll...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.56,2:11:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……把你们全像狗一样打死！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...shoot you all like dogs!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.07,2:11:48.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边保持秩序！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep order here!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.57,2:11:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持秩序，听见没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep order, I say.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.57,2:11:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洛威先生，指挥这条船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Lowe, man this boat.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.24,2:12:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。大家都没事吧？别慌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. ls everybody all right? Nobody panic.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.59,2:12:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.76,2:12:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们太迟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.18,2:12:16.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船头前面还有更多救生艇。守着这条。默多克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are more boats down the front. Stay with this one. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:16.51,2:12:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他倒是挺务实的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He seems to be quite practical.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.77,2:12:24.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别放下去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't lower it!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.77,2:12:26.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}砍断绳索！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut the falls!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.28,2:12:34.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:35.45,2:12:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这些人都退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back, you lot!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.12,2:12:40.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都给我退后！退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just stay back, the lot of you! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.96,2:12:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船开始散架了。我们时间不多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's starting to fall apart. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.29,2:12:48.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}默多克先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Murdoch?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.96,2:12:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}霍克利先生。你们两个，跟我来，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Hockley. You two, with me, now!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.71,2:12:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我是个生意人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a businessman, as you know...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.47,2:12:55.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我想跟你谈笔生意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and I have a business proposition for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.81,2:13:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.48,2:13:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救生艇都没了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The boats are gone!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.15,2:13:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校，那边还有救生艇吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel, are there any boats on that side?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.07,2:13:18.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有了，小姐，不过船头最前面还有几条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, miss, but there are a couple of boats all the way forward.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.62,2:13:20.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边，我带你去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way, I'll lead you.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.42,2:13:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么用？反正没人听我们的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the use? Nobody's listening to us anyway.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:30.00,2:13:31.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正吃饭时他们也不听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, they don't listen to us at dinner, either.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.67,2:13:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，我们拉吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, let's play.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.88,2:13:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}暖和暖和身子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep us warm.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.01,2:13:36.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《奥菲斯》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Orpheus."
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.18,2:13:43.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}淹死人配的音乐。这下我知道自己是头等舱的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Music to drown by. Now I know I'm in first class.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.86,2:13:53.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-人都哪去了？  -都还在船尾，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where is everyone?   -They're all still aft, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.19,2:13:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们就说定了，默多克先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have an understanding then, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.71,2:14:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男人们请退后！退后，听见没有！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will the men please hold back! Hold back, I say!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.05,2:14:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只上妇女和儿童！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women and children only!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.01,2:14:19.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.22,2:14:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来吧，夫人。这边。先生，退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come through, madame. This way. Step back, sir!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.39,2:14:27.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好去另一边看看。快去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better check the other side. Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.57,2:14:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在另一边找到她了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I found her, on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.07,2:14:38.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在等救生艇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waiting for a boat.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.99,2:14:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟他在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With him.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.66,2:14:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-还有妇女和儿童吗？  -都上船了，默多克先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Any more women and children?   -They're all aboard, Mr. Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.08,2:14:45.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那还有别人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyone else then?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.50,2:14:48.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-还有人吗？  -快点。快点吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Anyone else?   -Do hurry. Hurry along.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.09,2:14:57.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真他妈的见鬼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn it all to hell.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.76,2:15:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.38,2:15:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开枪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.80,2:15:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，先生，你不能从这儿过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, sir, you can't go through here.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.35,2:15:11.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样。好极了。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it. Splendid. Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.61,2:15:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备放船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prepare to lower.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.44,2:15:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}左边准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ready on the left.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.20,2:15:28.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take them down.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.71,2:15:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持平稳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep it steady.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.71,2:15:41.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两边一起放。稳着点。保持平稳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Both sides together. Steady. Keep it steady.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.68,2:15:44.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把她给我。  -爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Give her to me.   -Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:44.84,2:15:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事的，宝贝。别担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be fine, darling. Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.51,2:15:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸，上船吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Daddy, get in the boat.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.52,2:15:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是分开一小会儿。就一小会儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's good-bye for a little while. Only for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.60,2:15:54.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会有另一条船给爸爸们坐的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There'll be another boat for the daddies.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.23,2:15:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这条船是给妈妈和孩子们的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This boat is for the mummies and the children.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.52,2:15:58.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}牵着妈妈的手，做个乖孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hold Mummy's hand and be a good little girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.11,2:16:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不走我也不走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not going without you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.70,2:16:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，你现在必须走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you have to go, now.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.36,2:16:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.49,2:16:05.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上船，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get in the boat, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.87,2:16:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.12,2:16:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.20,2:16:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上船！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get on the boat!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.29,2:16:11.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，上船，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, get on the boat, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.46,2:16:15.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，看看你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh my God, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.88,2:16:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看着可真糟糕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look a fright.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.80,2:16:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.55,2:16:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿上这个。来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put this on. Come.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.72,2:16:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先上。我坐下一艘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on. I'll get the next one.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.81,2:16:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，没有你我不走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, not without you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.89,2:16:33.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会有事的。听我说，我会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be all right. Listen, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.06,2:16:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是幸存者，好吗？别担心我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a survivor, all right? Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.23,2:16:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，快上船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, go on. Get on.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.06,2:16:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和船另一边的一个军官说好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have an arrangement with an officer on the other side of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.15,2:16:41.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克和我会安全下船的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack and I can get off safely.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.24,2:16:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们两个都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Both of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.41,2:16:45.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.57,2:16:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己也有船要赶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got my own boat to catch.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.41,2:16:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去吧，快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.49,2:16:49.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船快坐满了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're almost full.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.41,2:16:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-上船吧，小姐。  -快走。快走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Step aboard, miss.   -Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.42,2:16:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请上船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step aboard, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.87,2:16:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是爸爸的乖女儿，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're daddy's good girl, all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.38,2:16:58.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我的小水手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're my little sailor.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.76,2:17:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请离开栏杆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clear the rail, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.43,2:17:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放船！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, lower away!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.52,2:17:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真会撒谎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a good liar.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.61,2:17:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差不多跟你一样会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Almost as good as you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.12,2:17:32.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本没什么——没什么安排，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no-- there's no arrangement, is there?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:34.12,2:17:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，有的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, there is.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.96,2:17:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只不过你从中捞不到什么好处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not that you'll benefit much from it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.04,2:17:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我总是赢，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I always win, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.80,2:17:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管用什么方式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One way or another.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.61,2:18:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.03,2:18:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拦住她！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop her!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.78,2:18:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝，你干什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.86,2:18:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.89,2:19:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝！你太傻了！你为什么要那样做，啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose! You're so stupid! Why did you do that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.89,2:19:19.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太傻了，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're so stupid, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.23,2:19:22.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么要那样做？为什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why did you do that? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.23,2:19:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跳，我也跳，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You jump, I jump, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.07,2:19:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.78,2:19:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。我走不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh God. I couldn't go.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.32,2:19:35.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't go, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.91,2:19:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。我们会想出办法的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right. We'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.25,2:19:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-至少我跟你在一起。  -我们会想出办法的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-At least I'm with you.   -We'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.22,2:19:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.60,2:20:00.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Move.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.40,2:20:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.53,2:20:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.79,2:20:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！快，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Come on Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.88,2:20:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose, come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.88,2:20:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走，露丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move Rose!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.61,2:20:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你们在一起过得开心！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope you enjoy your time together!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.33,2:21:06.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这有什么好笑的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What could possibly be funny?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.08,2:21:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把钻石放进了外套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I put the diamond in the coat.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.59,2:21:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我把外套披在了她身上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I put the coat on her!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.26,2:21:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.61,2:21:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dada!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.37,2:21:42.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不能丢下他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.04,2:21:48.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，来吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:50.04,2:21:52.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dada!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.31,2:22:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go back!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.36,2:22:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}方向错了！回来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the wrong way! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.61,2:22:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是那边！回来！停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, not that way! Come back! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:26.25,2:22:27.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.75,2:22:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.11,2:23:00.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.29,2:23:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.47,2:23:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.14,2:23:29.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救命！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:35.15,2:23:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救命！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:37.94,2:23:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, sir!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.11,2:23:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，请打开门！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, open the gate, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:40.90,2:23:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求求你，帮帮我们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help us, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.32,2:23:43.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮帮我们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help us!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.66,2:23:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-求求你！  -求求你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please!   -Please!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.49,2:23:47.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.50,2:23:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-快，快！  -快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on, come on!   -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:55.84,2:23:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.42,2:23:58.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:59.51,2:24:00.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-求求你！  -快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please!   -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.76,2:24:02.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.88,2:24:03.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.52,2:24:10.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，我把钥匙掉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, I dropped the keys.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.52,2:24:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等等，求求你！  -等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wait, please!   -Wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:14.02,2:24:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别走！求求你们，派人来救我们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't leave! Please, send for help!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:35.21,2:24:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿到了！是哪一把，露丝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it! Which one is it, Rose?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.54,2:24:39.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}短的那把。试试短的那把。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The short one. Try the short one.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.55,2:24:41.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.22,2:24:46.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了！插不进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no! It won't go in.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.80,2:24:48.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.39,2:24:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡住了！卡住了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's stuck! It's stuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.56,2:24:56.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-快！  -快点，杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on!   -Hurry, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.90,2:24:59.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-快点，杰克！  -快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hurry, Jack!   -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:02.24,2:25:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开了！开了！快！快跑，露丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it! I got it! Go! Go, Rose!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.24,2:25:06.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:18.92,2:25:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:23.26,2:25:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走，快走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move, move.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.60,2:25:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把那些桨放好。  -拿把桨垫在下面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get those oars in place.   -Get an oar under it.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.61,2:25:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住！稳住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold it! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.61,2:25:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.87,2:25:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这些吊架摇进来！把吊索挂好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get these davits cranked in! Let's get the falls hooked up!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:11.30,2:26:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:19.81,2:26:20.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续往上走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep going up!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:24.15,2:26:25.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别推了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop pushing!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.82,2:26:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.41,2:26:31.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给不给我们活路，你这个英国混蛋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you give us a chance to live, you limey bastard!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.16,2:26:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁敢从我这儿过去我就开枪！退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll shoot any man who tries to get past me! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:34.83,2:26:35.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.16,2:26:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:37.83,2:26:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说好的，该死的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had a deal, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.33,2:26:45.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的钱救不了你，也救不了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your money can't save you any more than it could save me.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:45.46,2:26:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:47.67,2:26:49.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只准妇女和儿童上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women and children only!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.52,2:26:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，汤米！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:18.58,2:27:19.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，威尔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Will!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.46,2:27:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后，该死的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now stand back, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:31.30,2:27:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轻点，轻点。稳住。稳住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gently, gently. Hold it. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.48,2:27:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我带着孩子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a child!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.48,2:27:48.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我带着孩子！  -让开一条路！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I have a child!   -Clear a path here!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:48.98,2:27:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求求你，我带着孩子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, I have a child!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.82,2:27:54.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了。她在这世上只有我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please. I'm all she has in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:55.45,2:27:56.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.83,2:27:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step back!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.33,2:27:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-求求你？  -来，把她给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please?   -Here, give her to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:00.37,2:28:01.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事了，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're all right, dearie.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:04.88,2:28:05.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give her here.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:07.88,2:28:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There, there.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:13.18,2:28:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，等等！安德鲁斯先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, wait, wait! Mr. Andrews!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:18.52,2:28:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.52,2:28:23.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你都不打算试一试吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Won't you even make a try for it?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.86,2:28:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很抱歉，我没能给你造一艘更坚固的船，小露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry that I didn't build you a stronger ship, young Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.20,2:28:34.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沉得很快。我们得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's going fast. We have to move.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.82,2:28:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:38.87,2:28:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好运，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck to you, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.37,2:28:43.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也祝你好运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:56.34,2:28:57.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}古根海姆先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Guggenheim?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:57.85,2:28:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是给您的，古根海姆先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are for you, Mr. Guggenheim.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.22,2:29:00.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用了，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:00.39,2:29:04.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们穿上了最好的衣服，准备像绅士一样沉下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are dressed in our best and are prepared to go down as gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:05.06,2:29:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们想来杯白兰地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we would like a brandy.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:07.73,2:29:10.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快把缆绳弄过来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the falls over here now!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:10.90,2:29:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让它们掉下去，然后再扶正。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let them drop. Then we'll right it.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:18.62,2:29:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Capitan?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.24,2:29:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长，我该去哪儿？求您了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Capitan, where should I go? Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.92,2:29:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长。船长。先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain. Captain. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:02.41,2:30:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。那就这样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. That's it, then.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:05.46,2:30:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，沃利。祝你好运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good-bye, Wally. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:08.12,2:30:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-再见，华莱士。  -再会，老伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good-bye, Wallace.   -So long, old chap.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:24.53,2:31:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样，他们幸福地一起生活了三百年……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so they lived happily together for 300 years...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:29.37,2:31:31.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在提尔纳诺之地……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in the land of Tir na nog...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.54,2:31:35.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永恒青春与美丽之乡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Land of eternal youth and beauty.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:10.58,2:32:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没时间了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.08,2:32:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}砍断那些缆绳！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut those falls!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:13.71,2:32:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}砍断！非砍不可就砍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut them! Cut them if you have to!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:16.59,2:32:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要一把刀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a knife!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:20.92,2:32:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快砍断缆绳！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut the falls now!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:23.22,2:32:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把它们砍开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut them loose!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:35.10,2:32:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}砍断那些该死的缆绳！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut those bloody falls!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.61,2:33:25.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:26.45,2:33:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……今晚能为大家演奏是我的荣幸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...it has been a privilege playing with you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:29.93,2:34:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得尽可能在船上多待一会儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to stay on the ship as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:31.97,2:34:32.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:45.03,2:34:46.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边。穿过栏杆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way. Through the rail.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.95,2:34:50.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:50.62,2:34:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jump.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:53.95,2:34:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:28.32,2:35:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我接住你。跳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you. Jump.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.57,2:35:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓住你了，小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got you, miss.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:38.25,2:35:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:09.61,2:36:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行！你会把船弄沉的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! You'll swamp us!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:24.04,2:36:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我虽然行过死荫的幽谷——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yea, though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death--
Dialogue: 0,2:36:27.46,2:36:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你能不能走快点，赶紧穿过那幽谷？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna walk a little faster through that valley there?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.51,2:37:22.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣母玛利亚，天主之母……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy Mary, mother of God...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:22.18,2:37:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……请现在为我们这些罪人祈祷，也为我们临终时祈祷。阿们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...pray for us sinners now and at the hour of our death. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:25.85,2:37:26.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万福玛利亚，满被圣宠者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hail Mary, full of grace....
Dialogue: 0,2:37:27.02,2:37:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:38.45,2:37:40.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:50.21,2:37:52.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又看见一个新天新地……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I saw a new heaven and a new earth...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:52.88,2:37:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……因为先前的天地已经过去了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...for the first heaven and the first earth had passed away...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:57.47,2:37:59.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……海也不再有了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and there was no more sea.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:05.56,2:38:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很快就结束了。一切很快就结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be over soon. It'll all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:14.24,2:38:15.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他要与他们同住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And He shall dwell with them.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:15.90,2:38:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要作他的子民，神要亲自与他们同在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they shall be His people and God Himself shall be with them...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.66,2:38:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……作他们的神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and be their God.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:22.83,2:38:23.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:24.91,2:38:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这就是我们初次相遇的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...this is where we first met.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:33.96,2:38:37.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}神要擦去他们一切的眼泪……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And God shall wipe away all the tears from their eyes...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:37.51,2:38:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……不再有死亡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and there shall be no more death.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:40.09,2:38:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不再有悲伤、哭号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neither shall there be sorrow or crying.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:43.10,2:38:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不再有疼痛……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neither shall there be any more pain...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:46.43,2:38:49.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……因为先前的事都过去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...for the former world has passed away.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:03.62,2:39:05.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的，拉快点！用力拉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody pull faster! And pull!
Dialogue: 0,2:39:29.23,2:39:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧，特鲁迪小姐！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on, miss Trudy!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:06.51,2:40:08.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓得紧紧的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on real tight.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:25.53,2:40:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天爷啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:34.83,2:40:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把浪挡住！挡住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep those breakers in! Keep them in!
Dialogue: 0,2:41:56.37,2:41:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得走了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to move!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:03.71,2:42:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我。我拉你过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your hand. I'll pull you over.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:05.13,2:42:06.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:06.26,2:42:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:07.34,2:42:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:10.14,2:42:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓住你了。我不会松手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got you. I won't let go.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:12.72,2:42:13.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，我抓住你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.98,2:42:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怎么了，杰克？  -我不知道。我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's happening, Jack?   -I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:37.33,2:42:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:20.71,2:43:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是现在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is it!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:33.89,2:43:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，杰克！天啊。天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, Jack! Oh, God. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:38.22,2:43:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:54.58,2:43:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船会把我们吸下去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ship is gonna suck us down.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:56.58,2:43:58.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的时候深吸一口气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take a deep breath when I say.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:04.42,2:44:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往水面蹬，一直蹬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kick for the surface and keep kicking.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:06.63,2:44:07.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别松开我的手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not let go of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:15.68,2:44:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会挺过去的，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're going to make it, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:16.97,2:44:17.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:18.10,2:44:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:24.44,2:44:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了！准备好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ready! Ready!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:26.94,2:44:27.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now!
Dialogue: 0,2:45:04.31,2:45:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack! Jack!
Dialogue: 0,2:45:49.19,2:45:50.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose!
Dialogue: 0,2:45:50.69,2:45:53.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开她！放开她！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get off her! Get off her!
Dialogue: 0,2:45:57.24,2:45:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}游啊，露丝！你得游！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Swim, Rose! I need you to swim!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:03.70,2:46:05.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续游。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep swimming.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:09.04,2:46:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好冷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:10.63,2:46:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}游啊，露丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Swim, Rose!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:16.55,2:46:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:19.89,2:46:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续游。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep swimming.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:21.22,2:46:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:24.52,2:46:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:25.68,2:46:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……爬上去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...get on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:27.56,2:46:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爬到上面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get on top.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:36.44,2:46:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:47.46,2:46:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}待在上面。待在上面，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay on it. Stay on, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:10.98,2:47:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在没事了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:14.98,2:47:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在没事了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:23.83,2:47:24.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Return...
Dialogue: 0,2:47:25.20,2:47:26.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……船！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the boats!
Dialogue: 0,2:47:31.00,2:47:33.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船会回来救我们的，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The boats are coming back for us Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:33.67,2:47:35.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再坚持一会儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:36.00,2:47:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们得划开避开吸力……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They had to row away for the suction...
Dialogue: 0,2:47:38.88,2:47:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但现在他们会回来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but now they'll be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:44.01,2:47:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看在上帝的份上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,2:47:45.64,2:47:46.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求求你们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please...
Dialogue: 0,2:47:47.18,2:47:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……帮帮我们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...help us!
Dialogue: 0,2:47:53.86,2:47:55.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:56.40,2:47:58.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要是回去，他们会把船挤翻的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we go back, they'll swamp the boat.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:58.82,2:48:00.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉你们，他们会把我们拽下去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll pull us right down, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:00.70,2:48:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，别说了。你吓到我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, knock it off. You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:03.53,2:48:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊，姑娘们，拿起桨。我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, girls, grab an oar. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:06.33,2:48:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了吗？我们在北大西洋中央。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you out of your mind? We're in the middle of the North Atlantic.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:09.70,2:48:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这些人想活还是想死？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, do you people want to live or do you want to die?!
Dialogue: 0,2:48:20.01,2:48:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们我一个都听不懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't understand a one of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:24.05,2:48:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,2:48:26.18,2:48:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面是你们的男人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your men out there!
Dialogue: 0,2:48:30.06,2:48:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有的是空位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's plenty of room for more.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:32.02,2:48:33.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这船上就会少一个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there'll be one less on this boat...
Dialogue: 0,2:48:34.02,2:48:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你要是再不闭上你那张嘴！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...if you don't shut that hole in your face!
Dialogue: 0,2:48:53.25,2:48:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边，把桨收进来。把这些船也绑在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, bring in your oars over there. And tie these boats together as well.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:01.76,2:49:04.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把绳子绑好绑紧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, make sure that's tied up nice and tight.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:07.60,2:49:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听我说，伙计们。我们必须回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, listen to me, men. We have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:10.60,2:49:14.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把所有女人从这条船转移到那条船……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to transfer all the women from this boat into that boat right now...
Dialogue: 0,2:49:14.23,2:49:15.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……请尽快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...aS quick as you can, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:15.44,2:49:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那边腾出些空间。前后移动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's create some space over there. Move forward and aft.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:27.95,2:49:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}越来越安静了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's getting quiet.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:31.95,2:49:35.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要几分钟……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just going to take a couple of minutes...
Dialogue: 0,2:49:35.79,2:49:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就能把船组织好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to get the boats organized.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:40.63,2:49:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你们怎么想，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know about you but...
Dialogue: 0,2:49:42.63,2:49:46.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我打算写一封措辞严厉的信……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...L intend to write a strongly worded letter...
Dialogue: 0,2:49:46.47,2:49:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……给白星航运公司，说说这一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to the White Star Line about all this.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:56.48,2:49:58.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:04.82,2:50:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you do that.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:07.82,2:50:10.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说再见。还没到时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you say your good-byes. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:11.33,2:50:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:13.16,2:50:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我好冷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so cold.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:15.50,2:50:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，露丝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, Rose...
Dialogue: 0,2:50:18.17,2:50:19.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你会离开这里的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you're gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:21.00,2:50:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会继续活下去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna go on...
Dialogue: 0,2:50:23.84,2:50:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你会生很多孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and you're gonna make lots of babies.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:26.34,2:50:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会看着他们长大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're gonna watch them grow.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:30.01,2:50:31.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会老去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna die an old...
Dialogue: 0,2:50:31.30,2:50:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……变成老太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...an old lady.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:32.85,2:50:34.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在床上温暖地死去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...warm in her bed.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:36.18,2:50:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:38.19,2:50:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是今晚。不是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not this night. Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:41.02,2:50:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:45.69,2:50:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉不到我的身体了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't feel my body.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:49.53,2:50:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赢得那张船票，露丝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Winning that ticket, Rose...
Dialogue: 0,2:50:51.16,2:50:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……是我这辈子最幸运的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...was the best thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:55.37,2:50:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它让我遇见了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It brought me to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:58.83,2:51:01.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很感激，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm thankful for that, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:01.83,2:51:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很感激。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm thankful.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:06.63,2:51:07.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must...
Dialogue: 0,2:51:08.84,2:51:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你必须给我这个荣幸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you must do me this honor.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:13.85,2:51:17.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须答应我，你会活下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must promise me that you'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:19.35,2:51:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会放弃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That you won't give up...
Dialogue: 0,2:51:22.19,2:51:24.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……不管发生什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:26.86,2:51:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管多么绝望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No matter how hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:32.36,2:51:34.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在答应我，露丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Promise me now, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:36.70,2:51:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永远不要放弃这个承诺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And never let go of that promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:40.71,2:51:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我答应你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:44.17,2:51:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永不放弃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never let go.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:48.72,2:51:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远不放弃，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll never let go, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:53.55,2:51:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远不放弃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll never let go.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:19.33,2:52:20.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正前方，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right ahead, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:24.00,2:52:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}举桨！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oars!
Dialogue: 0,2:52:26.00,2:52:27.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到有东西在动吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you see any moving?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.67,2:52:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，长官。都没有动静，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir. None moving, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:31.17,2:52:32.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}检查一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check them.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:32.84,2:52:34.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那支桨拿到这儿来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring that oar up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:41.02,2:52:42.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}检查他们。确认一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check them. Make sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:43.44,2:52:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些人都死了，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are dead, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:45.56,2:52:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，划桨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, give way.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:47.19,2:52:48.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢速前进。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ahead easy.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:55.03,2:52:56.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心桨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Careful with your oars.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:57.12,2:52:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别打到他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't hit them.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:00.70,2:53:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面有活人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anyone alive out there?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:04.54,2:53:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人能听见我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:08.54,2:53:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面有活人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anyone alive out there?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:17.72,2:53:18.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们等得太久了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We waited too long.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:22.85,2:53:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就继续检查他们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, keep checking them!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:24.73,2:53:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续找！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep looking!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:27.23,2:53:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面有活人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anyone alive out there?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:33.24,2:53:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人能听见我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:46.42,2:53:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，约瑟芬……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come, Josephine...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:49.75,2:53:54.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……坐上我的飞行器\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in my flying machine
Dialogue: 0,2:53:55.76,2:53:58.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它飞上去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's up she goes
Dialogue: 0,2:54:00.93,2:54:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}飞上去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Up she goes
Dialogue: 0,2:54:08.44,2:54:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，约瑟芬……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come, Josephine...
Dialogue: 0,2:54:12.94,2:54:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……坐上我的飞行器……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in my flying....
Dialogue: 0,2:54:39.14,2:54:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:58.32,2:54:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:00.16,2:55:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有艘船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a boat.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:14.67,2:55:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:28.52,2:55:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有艘船，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a boat, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:14.23,2:56:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:16.73,2:56:18.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:20.40,2:56:21.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:22.91,2:56:24.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:25.24,2:56:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:27.58,2:56:29.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。回来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back. Come back!
Dialogue: 0,2:56:31.41,2:56:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,2:56:35.04,2:56:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人能听见我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:56:37.42,2:56:39.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里什么都没有，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:41.59,2:56:42.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:44.43,2:56:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:53.60,2:56:55.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永不放手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll never let go.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:55.36,2:56:56.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:39.77,2:57:41.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}掉头！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come about!
Dialogue: 0,2:58:02.96,2:58:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一千五百人掉进海里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fifteen hundred people went into the sea...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:07.14,2:58:10.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……当泰坦尼克号从我们脚下沉没时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..When Titanic sank from under us.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:11.97,2:58:15.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……附近漂着二十艘救生艇……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There were twenty boats floating nearby...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:16.31,2:58:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……只有一艘回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and only one came back.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:20.48,2:58:21.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一艘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:23.32,2:58:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……有六个人从水里获救……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six were saved from the water...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:26.49,2:58:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……包括我自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...myself included.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:29.32,2:58:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:31.83,2:58:33.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一千五百人中的六个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...out of fifteen hundred.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:37.00,2:58:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Afterward...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:39.50,2:58:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……救生艇上的七百个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the seven hundred people in the boats...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:42.30,2:58:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……除了等待，什么也做不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...had nothing to do but wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:46.01,2:58:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等待死亡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait to die.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:48.18,2:58:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等待活下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait to live.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:50.84,2:58:53.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等待一个宽恕……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait for an absolution...
Dialogue: 0,2:58:53.51,2:58:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而那永远不会到来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that would never come.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:59.58,3:00:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，我觉得您在下边找不到您的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, I don't think you'll find any of your people down here.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:02.21,3:00:03.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里全是统舱乘客。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all steerage.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:06.59,3:00:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的头发是红褐色，红褐色，红褐色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His hair is reddish brown, reddish brown, reddish brown.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:10.26,3:00:11.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}白胡子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}White beard.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:12.09,3:00:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有别的乘客名单了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't there another passenger list?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:13.76,3:00:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有别的名单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is no other list.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:15.05,3:00:16.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许他在另一艘船上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps he's on another ship.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:16.76,3:00:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们已经尽力了，夫人。非常抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're doing all we can, ma'am. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:41.96,3:00:44.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我最后一次见到他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the last time! ever saw him.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:45.13,3:00:48.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他后来当然结了婚，继承了百万家产。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He married, of course, and inherited his millions.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:49.30,3:00:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但29年的大崩盘重创了他的产业……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the Crash of '29 hit his interests hard...
Dialogue: 0,3:00:53.13,3:00:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那年他把手枪塞进了嘴里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and he put a pistol in his mouth that year.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:55.97,3:00:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少我读到的是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or so I read.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:10.65,3:01:12.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请问您叫什么名字，女士？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I take your name please, love?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:15.16,3:01:16.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}道森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dawson.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:18.66,3:01:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗丝·道森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose Dawson.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:21.50,3:01:22.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:29.67,3:01:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一直没查到杰克的任何消息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We never found anything on Jack.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:31.96,3:01:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本没有他的任何记录。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no record of him at all.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:34.51,3:01:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，不会有，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, there wouldn't be, would there?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:37.18,3:01:39.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到现在为止，我从没提起过他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I've never spoken of him until now.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:40.64,3:01:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对谁都没提过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:42.85,3:01:44.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连你祖父也没提过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not even your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:45.19,3:01:49.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女人的心是一片深藏秘密的海洋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A woman's heart is a deep ocean of secrets.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:50.02,3:01:53.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在你知道了，有个叫杰克·道森的人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But now you know there was aman named Jack Dawson...
Dialogue: 0,3:01:54.03,3:01:56.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他救了我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and that he saved me...
Dialogue: 0,3:01:56.36,3:01:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……以一个人能被拯救的所有方式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in every way that a person can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:01.70,3:02:04.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至没有他的一张照片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even have a picture of him.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:06.87,3:02:10.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他只活在我的记忆里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He exists now only in my memory.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:15.55,3:02:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯尔迪什号，米尔2号正在上浮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keldysh, Mir 2 on our way to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:35.57,3:02:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本想留着找到钻石时再抽的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was saving this for when I found the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:47.75,3:02:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:51.92,3:02:53.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三年了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three years...
Dialogue: 0,3:02:54.09,3:02:56.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我满脑子想的都是泰坦尼克号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... I've thought of nothing except Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:57.59,3:02:59.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我始终没弄明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I never got it.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:02.56,3:03:04.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没真正体会过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never let it in.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:45.84,3:14:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}英语（美国）\N{\rEN\blur0.8}English - US
